<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Bangubangu</book>
  <para style="h">MALAKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Malako</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mlk</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mlk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Musau uleela wa Yeesu Kilisito<optbreak />bebya byesinya Malako</para>
  <para style="mt1">MALAKO</para>
  <para style="imt">Shwedelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ni Malako ni wesinya kiiki kitabu, baki mutanga lungi Yoane-Malako (Byeeta mitonge 12.12). Yuu Malako ndeene yumo hamukidi ha mitonge ba Yeesu. Ila njyumo hamukidi ha baba be sumukanga na Petelo mutonge wa Yeesu kilisito. Mauya mabule mee sinya Malako we mateejya kukidila Petelo. Malako we sinya kiiki kitabu mukuboya ti wa saudile baaba basidi Bayaudi Musau ulweela. Iye hesinyeye kiiki kitabu ndeene mukulola kilao kya kalekale bidi Matayo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Malako wa monesha ti Yeesu ni Mwaana wa Kabejya na lungi Mwaana wa Mundu. Wamonesha lungi ti Yeesu weeva kuvavubila bandu mudimo na kukwihaana tuulo mukuboya ti wabafuule. Maama mauya umabanga mu kitabu kya Malako 10.45. Haŋo, Yeesu wa jyongola biibi: Kumona miimi Mwaana wa Mundu sivava mukuboya ti bangundeele mudimo. Ila vava mukuboya ti na vubilange nengutuula mwejyo waami, nafuule bandu babule.</para>
  <para style="ip">Malako wa yakula kukidila kubutuka kwa Yeesu na kukidila bulenge bwaaye. Ila ukiyakula mauya ma Yeesu hasiteliye mukulu wa mundu. Kusomba kibelo kya kumbala mupaka kibelo kya kumi, Malako we monesha mooso meeta Yeesu mu mukola wa Galilaya. Mukibelo kya kumi na kumi na yimo na kibelo kya kumi na mutuba, wamonesha beebya byeeta Yeesu mu kisi kya Yudea na mumukola ukata wa Yelusalemu. Kumongo, wa saula kukidila kumota kwa Yeesu haulu ha musalaba na kufukuka kwaaye. Hamukidi habitabu binaa bya Mauya ma lweela ma Yeesu Kilisito, Kitabu kya Malako ni kiki yakananga kindiidi. Munda mwa kiiki kitabu, huya ao kumo dikata dikiyakula Malako, ni kulabudibwa kwa Yeesu Kilisito.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Musau gulegela gubu sinyibwa na Malako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Egu i Mwiizi Gulegela wa Yeesu Kilisito, Mwaana wa Kabejya. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Byeebya byayesinyibwa mubusinye bwa mubushi Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">Kabejya gubu boya biibi: «Na taki anga mu sagujyi waami mabusu goobe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">eyu wa longanga zila ya wakidilanga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Malaki 3.1; Isa 40.3; Kul 23.3</char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />I yoowa gudi muuta mwandu mu ibalagaaza:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Mulonge zila ya Vidi, zila yaayi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">yagololoke zii.»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yohane gubu weena kwii balagaaza, heekilu saula mauya ma Kabejya ti: Bandu basama bubi bwaabo mukuboya ti Kabejya wabafiile lusa bubi bwaabo. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Ihani bandu ba butelegejya wowa mwiizi na ugu tabuka, uhuma u Yelusalemu na mu kyee ihindi kyooso kya Bayuuda haba vueya udi Yohane lu yabika, haba haajya lusa lwa bubi bwa babuta mabusu ga Kabejya; Yohane haya bayabika mu luuyi lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yohane gubutubila ngubu yababu fuma na mamenywa ga Ngamia. Yohane gubu yiganga mubya wa iseba mu lutinu lwayi, gubwanangi muudya zigi na buki bwa juki. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" /><note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.7 </char></note>Yohane haya booya ti: «Udi mundu yungi wa vueyanga manyuma gaami, gudi na butangala unikila. Miimi nidi haasi waayi shilu bengenena unyinama uganga miguzi ya tukokologo twaayi. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" /><note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.8 </char></note> Miimi, nibu ba yabika munda mwa meema, haboobwa, eyu wa baba yabikanga munda mwa Tima dya Kabejya».<figure style="fig" alt="Jean baptiste prêche apropos de Jésus" file="WWA0389b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="1.8">Yohane wasaula mauya kukidila Yeesu</figure><verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyabikibwa kwa Yeesu na kusolelebwa na Shetani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:11">4.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Mu ihindi kyeekya, Yeesu gubu huma u Nazareti <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeesu mwaana wa Kabejya</char></note> munda mwa moola wa Galilaya, haya weena udi Yohane wa muyabii'i mu luuyi lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Yohane haya muyabi'a Yeesu munda mwa meema; haŋa Yeesu heebu lozo'a munda mwa meema, haya mona lububi lwa yigangula, haba mona Tima dya Kabejya dya sala heegulu wa Yeesu bidi tagaya. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Muhuya hawa huma u lububi hawa boya: «Beebe i Mwaana waami wandu vula koo nindu».<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Hangahaŋa, Tima dya Kabejya hadya mu yiisha kwii balagaaza, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />haya kaana kwii balagaaza masu moomi ganaa, Shetaani muu musolola. Gubwa nangi hamonga na bwinanyama na Malaika ba bwanangi muu muvubila.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeesu wa somba mwambu waayi u Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mat 4.12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Haŋa haba bumuziti'a Yohane mu Afwalubi, Yeesu gubu weena u Galilaya. Heekilu sawiila bandu mahuuya galegela uhuma udi Kabejya, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />haya boya: «Masu gabengeneena. Butangala bwa Kabejya bwa nenama. Haboobwa mu fululu'i, mutabu'i Mahuya Galegela ga Kabejya»!<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Lusu lumu, Yeesu gubu weena ayegelanga ha ngondu wa iziba kya Galilaya, Yeesu haya mu mona Simoni hamonga na mu waayi Andele. Ebu muu tashwa tubabila twaabu mu meema manee ba bwanangi balu sheeha na tubabila. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yeesu haya ba sawiila: «Mu vueye mu nikumbi. Na miimi na mibi'anga ba sheha atumbulanga ba bandu.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Hanga haŋa, haba sama totwa tu babila twaabu haba mu kumba Yeesu. <figure style="fig" file="avnt016. jpj" size="span" ref="1.18">Hakeaŋa habasama tubabila twaabo. </figure> <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Haŋa Yeesu haya weena lungi mabusu, haya mona koo'a mabusu gayi, Yakobo na Yohane, baana ba Zebedayo na mu waayi ebu neebu ba bwanangi munda mwa mutumbu waabu mulonga tu babila. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Hangahaŋa Yeesu haya bataŋana. Haba musiga shaabu Zebedayo munda mwa mutumbu na ba vubi baayi ihani haba mu kumba Yeesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa fuula mundu gudi na misimbusimbu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4.31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Hebuhwa bibi, Yeesu na ndingisi* yaayi haba weena u moola wa Kapelanaumu. Haŋa lusu lwa Sabato,* Yeesu haya shweela munda mwa mu sinagogi, heekilu ludi'a bandu mahuya ga Kabejya. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Baa benange muku muteejya haba hanunu'a na uludi'a kwaayi. Ndibu baludi'a byeebya biluludi'a balangidijyi ba Buta;* gububaludi'a na butangala ukila byeebya biluludi'a balangidijyi ba Mahuya golulu.* <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Akeaŋa kwenange momwa munda mwa sinagogi mundu yumo wenee na mizuka na wene mukuyaba: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«Kudi kaayi amukidi iitu, na beebe Yeesu wa nazaleti? Waava kutusubisha? Ngiyuka ti beebe ni; Sidinabubi wa yiisha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kuyiisha: diidi huya haŋa diki monesha mundu wa yena bua dimo kukidila kusaudibwa na mundu yungi</char></note> Kabejya»! <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yeesu bya hanunukila wowa muzuka na kuboya: «Bita! Nyomoka munda mwa yu mundu.» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Ni wowa muzuka bya wabilusha yowa mundu, na kunyomoka munda mwaye. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Bandu booso benange haŋa byaba hanuka. Byaba kwiyujya hamukidi haabo: «Mbike bindu biibi? Diidi ni langidijyu diya? Yu mundu udi na butangala bwa kuyakula nee na mizuka, naiyo yamuteejya!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Hakeaŋa dedya longo dya Yeesu hadya bambana nee kulojya mu kiba kyooso kya Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafuula bandu babule bene na lufu na baaba bene na mizuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mat 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Nyuma yabebya Yeesu bya nyomoka mu sinagogi*, haya yena kukumo na Yakobo na Yohane ku kyende kya Simoni na Andelee. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Habe sosoka momwa haba musaudila ti najye mweno na Simoni wene butandabale mu busazu manee wene na kitukutuku kinyumine. Akeaŋa he sosoka Yeesu byaba mu saudila kunemenwa kwaye. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Haŋo Yeesu haya tuluka tonono na yowa mwamukazi, haya mu talusha kwa kumukwata ku kiboko. Akeaŋa bya fuuka na kitukutuku hakya musama, naiye bya somba kubaabila bidyazi bya kudya.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Hayee bambana kyoolwa, yuba kusala, bandu byaba muvishila Yeesu bandu booso badi na lufu na booso badi na mizuka. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Bandu booso ba wowa mukola byaba kumaana busu bwa kibelo kya kyende. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Na Yeesu bya fuula bandu babule beenange na nyifu mbalambala. Na kujyanga mizuka yabule; ndee yiabila mbangu yaiyo kuyakula kumona ye mu yuka iye ni naani.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu walangidila bandu mu kisi kya Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Mukisi pupu, kukidi kakunga, Yeesu bya buuka bya nyomoka mu kyende, bya yena bua disivane mundu, na haya somba kuhaajya. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni na bezinaye byaba yena kwe mukeba. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Haŋa habee mumona, byaba musaudila ti: «Vidi-nyambi bandu booso bakikukeba.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Haŋo Yeesu naiye bya basaudila: «Twene mumukola ungi wa tonono naka saule mauya ma Kabejya koo naako, kumona ti, ni byambevila.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Haŋo Yeesu bya yena mukye kiba kyooso kya Galilaya. Muku yakula mauya ma Kabejya muma sinagogi maabo na kujyanga mizuka munda mwa bandu.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafuula mundu yidi na kivu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-13">Luk 5.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Lusu lumo, mundu yumo yidi na kivu weyena busu bwa Yeesu. Bya fukika manyu busu bwa Yeesu, bya kwiaya na kuboya ti: «Itu wavula, ukibambana kungufuula!» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yeesu bya mumonena lusa. Byaolola kiboko kyaye, byamulengela na kumusaudila: «Navula. Ufuuke!» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Akeaŋa lufu lwa kivu halwa musama yowa mundu bya fuuka. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Nyuma yaaŋo, Yeesu bya mumonesha zila wa yeene na kumulanga biibi: <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />«Teejya bilwela: Ndusaudila mundu nee yumo maama mauya!, Ni uka kwimoneshe kwa mupelo*, na ukahaane salaka* kudi Kabejya ku kumo dya kutooka beebya bye sinya Musa kwaku monesha kudi bandu ti wafuuka».<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itu mundu wa fuuka na lufu lwa kivu, wene mukuta beebya ti watabukibwe lungi hamukidi habandu ao mukilongo. Lola Walawi 13.45-46; 14.1-32 </char></note><verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Bobwa bwe yena yowa mundu, bya somba kumwangidijya wowa musau mabua mooso. Kukidila bebya Yeesu nde samuna lungi kushwela mumukola ungi hululu. Bya yakana mubua dyabunga. Nee mbebya, bandu babule be yena kudiye mbanga yooso.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafuula mundu mulebele bibandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Masu mashoo kukila, Yeesu bya haluka lungi ku Kafalnaumu, bandu habe teezya mukizi wakuboya ti udi mukyende, <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Bangi bandu babule habaava na kuyula mukyende nee ngu kibelo ndakweene bua dya kuyakana. Baa bandu booso Yeesu bya yakana muku basaudila Mauya ma Kabejya.<verse eid="MRK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Kee kindi bandu bamo banaa haba muvishila Yeesu mundu yumo wenee bulebele bibandu. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Kumona ndabe samuna kumushwala tonono na Yeesu kukidila bungi bwa bandu. Haŋo byaba banda haulu hakinduulu kya kyende<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bamo Bayaudi bene mukuzika binduulu byabo na makombwa haulu bazika na malenge haulu hamalenge ni bazika na matekemabumba</char></note> byaba tubula dimo bua ku kinduulu mudyakedee bua dyene Yeesu; haba mushajya yowa mundu wene bulebele bibandu mukalaku kaye ke ladilangeye. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yeesu heeva moneeye butabuke bwaabo, ni haya jyongodela yowa mundu wene bulebele bibandu: «Mwaana waami, wa monenebwa lusa bubi bwobe».<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Bamo balangidishi ba buta,* benange haŋa haba hejya muma tima maabo: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Kwakaayi yu mundu wa jyongola bibi? Wa yakula mauya ma mbingu kwa Kabejya! Ndakudi mundu husamuna kusheejya bubi Kabejya iye alaa!» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Akeaŋa Yeesu haya yuka mwiejyo yaabo, haya ba saudila: «Kwakaayi mukiejya beebya muma tima miinu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Mungusaudile ngike kindu kidi kieleela kuyakula kwa yuu mundu yidi bulebele bibandu?: ‹Bubi bwoobe bwasheela.› Au kumusaudila ti: ‹Buuka buula tanda dyoobe na usumuke?› <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Kwa biibi, ngivula muyuke ti mimi Yeesu ni kiyakananga na butangala bwa ku monena bandu lusa lwa bubi bwaabo muune mu kisi.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:10">Haŋo Yeesu bya jyongodela yowa mundu vane bu lebele bibandu: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Na kusaudila ti taluka; buula busazu dyobe na weene ku kyende kyobe»!<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Akeaŋa, bandu booso muku mulola, yowa mundu haya taluka, haya buula busazu bwaye, haya yena byaye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 2:12">Bandu booso haba hanunuka. Na ku mu tumbijya Kabejya na kuboya: «Nda twemonanga kumo bidi diidi»!<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa taana Lawi wamujyange</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Nyuma ya haŋo, Yeesu haya yena lungi hangondo ya ziba dya Galilaya. Kyandu kyooso kya bandu byaba yeena kudiiye, naiye bya somba kuba langidila.<verse eid="MRK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Hava nangiye mukukila, haya mona mundu yumo kitaanibwa Lawi mwaana wa Alfayo. Yowa Lawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lawi ukitaanibwa lungi Matayo, Lola Matayo 9.9-13</char></note> uvane mukuyakana ku biloo ya kuajya mulambu. Yeesu haya mujyongodela: «Ŋjyange!» Hakeaŋa Lawi haya taluka, haya mu jyanga.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Nyuma ya bebya, Yeesu haya yena mukudya bidyazi, mukyende kya Lawi. Baku haajya milambu babule na badi na bubi naibo be nange kukumo naye mukudya na Yeesu na ba dingisi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dingisi mundu ao mbandu bakilangidibwa na mundu yidi haulu yaabo kukidila kuyuka ao badi haasi ya yowa kibalangidila</char></note> baaye, kumona bandu babule bidi baba be mujyanganga.<verse eid="MRK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Haŋa bamo balangidijyi ba buta* benange ba mwajyo wa mafalisayo* habe mumona Yeesu mukudya kukumo na bandu badi na bubi na baaba bakihajya milambu, haaŋo haba yuujya badingisi baaye ti: «Kwa kaayi mulangidishi wiinu ukidya kukumo na baaba bakihajya milambu na baa badi na bubi?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Yeesu hetejyeeye bebya, haya basaudila: «Bandu basidi na lufu ndabaki kebanga mubuki, ba kimukeba baaba badi na lufu. Sivava kutaana bandu badi buludi busu bwa Kabejya, ila baaba badi na bubi».<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bandu ba yuujya Yeesu kukidila kuajya kusidi kudya bidyazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Lumo lusu badingisi* ba Yohane na Mafalisayo* benange mukuajya kwa kusidi kudya bidyazi. Haŋo, bandu habaava yuujya Yeesu, haba muyuujya ti: «Kwakaayi ba dingisi ba Yohane na mafalisayo ba kiajyanga bila kudya bidyazi ila ba dingisi boobe ndaba kita biibi?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yeesu byaba yaka: «Mukihejya ti, bee taanibwa ku halusi baki bambana kubenga kudya bidyazi na mwini halusi udi nabo kukumo? Ndabeebyo, kindi kyoso kya badi kukumo na mwiini halusi nda baki bambana kubenga kudya bidyazi. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ila kindi kivanga kiyakana mwiini wa halusi nda kuyakana kwakale hamukidi haabo; keekya kindi ni kyabiazya kusidi kudya bidyazi.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />Mundu nee yumo ndaki shonanga kiba kya ngubu yiya haulu ha ngubu yi kulukulu. Itu waata beebya, kekya kilaka kiya ki handa yeya ngubu yikulukulu na buhandike buyakana bukataadi.<verse eid="MRK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Byakebe mundu ndaki hukula divai diya mu taba dya biseba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bayaudi bene mukulungakanya taba na biseba, bene mukubika meema na maziwa na divai na maani. Debya taba hadyenange diya dyene muku hama, ila itu kyasomba kunuuka, ndakite kinyumine na kukidila bebya ndakyakuama lungi.</char></note> bi kulukulu. Kumona itu waata beebya, dedya divai diya dihanda yeeya taba ya biseba, kwabiibi, idyo divai dihukuka na beebya bihinga byabiseba bi vundaana. Kwabebya divai diya diki bikibwanga bobo mutaba dya biseba biya»!<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na lusu lwa sabato*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Lumo lusu lwa Sabato*, Yeesu na badingisi baye benange mukukila hamukidi ha makunda ma ngano. Habeenage mukukila, badingisi* baaye haba somba ku huula tumuka twa ngano. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mafalisayo* kumona bebya haba mu saudila Yeesu ti: «Mona bangu! Kwakayi badingisi boobe baata bindu biki benga buta* bwa Kabejya kutebwa lufuku lwa Sabaato?» <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yeesu bya bayaka: «Ndamwee sinyulula beebya byeta Daudi lumo lusu kukumo na bezinaye hetejyeye zala na kukushwa byakudya? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />We shwela mukyende kya Kabejya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mumafuku ma Kolo Daudi kyende kya Kabejya kyene ndakye lukibwa ku Yelusalema.</char></note> na kubuula mikati ye haana bandu kwa Kabejya byaadya na bya habila benagiye nabo, nee nguboya ti Bamupelo bobo ni baki bambana kudya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola 1samweli 21.3-7; Balawi 24.9</char></note>. Weeta bebya kindi kyene Abiathadi, mukulu wa Bamupelo.» <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yeesu haya basaudila lungi: «Sabato* ye teebwa kukidila mundu; nda mundu we teebwa kukidila Sabato*! <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Kukidila bibi, miimi Mwana wa mundu ni mwiini wa Sabaato».<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafuula mundu lusu lwa Sabato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Yeesu wa shweela lungi mu sinagogi. Mukye kyende mwenange mundu yidi na kyazaza kilebele. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Ba bandu haba kidi mulola bamone itu umu fuulanga lusu lwa Sabato,* kwa kuboya ti, bamone zila yaku musosela.<verse eid="MRK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yeesu haya mujyongodela yoowa uvanange na kiboko kilebele: «Taluka kila busu bwa bandu booso bakumone.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Haŋo Yeesu bya bayuujya: «Buune, mbilweela kuta kindu kilweela lufuka lwa sabato ao kuta kindu kisidi kilweela? Ni kuboya ti, mbilweela kufuula au ku yaa mundu lufuku lwa Sabato?» Ila ibo haba bita bii. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yeesu haya balola booso sokosoko, haya zinguka; bya mona susu mutima dyaye kumona kuuma kwa matima maabo. Kisha bya jyongodela yowa wene na kiboko kilebele: «Olola kiboko kyobe!» Na iye bya olola kiboko kyaye, na kiboko kyaye hakya fuuka.<verse eid="MRK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Hakeaŋa, Bafalisayo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bafalisayo = Pharisiens</char></note> haba nyomoka haaza ha sinagogi haba yeena mukuta kaole kukumo na bandu ba Helode ti, bamone zila yaku muyaa Yeesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiandu kikata kya viila Yeesu hangondo ha ziba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yeesu na badingisi baye haba hezela mudedya bua haba yena hangonda ha ziba dya Galilaya na kiandu kikata kya bandu; hakya mulonda. Kumona beteejya bindu byooso byetangeye. Bandu benyomoka ku Galilaya na Yudea, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />na bangi haba nyomoka ku Yelusalemu, Idumea mwajyo wa luuyi lwa Yolodani, na bangi hangondo ha kisi kya Tilo na Sidoni na booso be yenaa kudi Yeesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Kumona bukata bwa kyandu kya bandu Yeesu haya saudila ba dingisi* baye ti bamu bikile tonaa mutumbu umo ushee, kumona ti kiandu kyabandu ndakimufinga. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Kumona Yeesu wefuula bandu babule, na baba booso benange na nyifu bemufinganga kwaku boya ti Yeesu waba lengele. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Na haŋa baba bandu badi na mizuka habe mumona Yeesu, haba hona busu bwa Yeesu ibo muku bazya miuya: «Beebe udi Mwaana wa Kabejya!» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ila Yeesu bya babengela kushu minyee ndaba saudila mundu ti iye ni naani.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa sobola mitonge yaye kumi na yibidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Kaindi kashoo kukila, Yeesu haya banda haulu ya kituulu, haya taana bandu beevuleye, haba yena bua dyenangiye. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Iye bya sobola hamukidi haabo kumi na babidi, haya baabila zina dya mitonge. Yeesu uva basobola kuboya ti bayakane naye, na wayakanange mukubayiisha mukusaula Mauya ma Kabejya. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Na bya baabila butangala bwa kujyanga mizuka. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Maama ni mazina ma baba mitonge kumi na babidi: Simoni, yowa we hunika Yeesu zina dya Petelo, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakobo na Yohane baana ba Zebedayo Yeesu haya baabila ibo booso zina dya Boanalegesi, kumonesha ti «Mbaana ba mukungulu» <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Bya sobola byakebee na Andele, na Filipi, na Balatelemi, na Mateo, na Tomasi, na Yakobo mwaana wa Alufayo, Tadayo, na Simoni Muziloti, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Bya sobola lungi na Yuda Isikaliyote, yowa we tuula Yeesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bakwaye na Yeesu bamukeba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Hani Yeesu hayaweena ku kyendi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kyende = Maison</char></note>. Igandu kya bandu hakyamukumba gungi kukuu, hayaaluka lungi mukyende habafi'a ku kyendi, Yeesu na mitongi yaayi habakushwa udya biyaazi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bidyaazi = Nourriture</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Hanha Bawayi na Yeesu hababu telegejya biibi, habaweena kumubugula, manee bakwaye bavaboya ti Yeesu ndate na kaololo.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Butangala bwa Yeesu bubuhuma uni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12.22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Balangidijyi ba buta, babuhuma u Yelusalema haba kilu sagula ti: «Yeesu wabandwa na Belzebuli. Misimbusimbu, haba kidi muu boya lungi ti ngu kidila butangala bwa yuu Belzebuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat 12.24 Belzebuli ni zina dingi dya Shetaani, kumona iye ni mukulu wa misimbusimbu</char></note> na mweedi wa Shetaani, iboobwa Yeesu byeedi mujyanga Misimbusimbu.» <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Ukidila biibi Yeesu haya bataŋana na haya bateela muele: «Byasa muni'anga bini, Shetaani uyijyangijyeena iyu mwinindu ujyanga Shetaani? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ishu bandu babutangala bubumu bwa gabulu'a mu bihindi ngu boya tii, boobwa butangala nda bootebama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Butangala = Royaume</char></note> ishu ndabudi muulwa ebu bunindu, ndaboo tebama! Bwa honanga. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Na ibyanga byeebya bandu ba ilongo kikimu ishu bagabulu'a ibu kwa ebu, kyee'a ilongo nda kyoo talu'a. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Itu Musimbusimbu naiye waaba butangala bwaye, buubutangala bwalwa na buu bungi nguboya ti wakwivundanya iye mwinikindu haŋa butangala bwaye bwawa.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Unindu, mundu ndo shweela mu yendi kya mundu gudi na butangala, tii, wabugudi bindu bidi munda mwa yendi kyaayi, ishu mabusu ndibu muganga mwiini yendi myilu. Ishu wohwa umuganga myilu ihani haya samunanga ubugula bindu bidi munda mwa yendi kyaayi.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Namisawiila unindu: Unindu Kabejya wa bamonenga lusa, bubi bwa bandu badi na bubi na baba balu kaya bandu booso bafwilwanga lusa, mu bubi bwaabu booso baaba bamu kayanga Kabejya; <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />haboobwa, mundu yoowa wooso wakayanga Tima dya Kabejya,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tima dya Kabejya = Saint-Esprit</char></note> Kabejya nda kumufiila lusa neelumo! Manee mundu watanga bibi waya nanga na bubi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bubi = Péche</char></note> Kwakumona ti bobwa bubi bwooso buyakananga kukumo naye bwa masu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Masu = Jours</char></note> gooso bila ufwiilwa lusa bubi bwaayi.» <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yeesu gubu sagula bibi manee balangidijyi ba Buta<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Buta = Torah</char></note> babu boya ti: «Gudi na muhehe gubigubi».<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilongo kya unindu kya Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Nyuma yahaŋo Najyaayi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Najyaayi = Sa mère</char></note> na Yeesu na bawaayi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bawaayi = Ses frères</char></note> na Yeesu habafi'a. Haba tebama haajya. Habe nange bakidi haaza haba yiisha mundu wenangi kumutaŋana Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Momwa munda mwa kyende, bandu babutu babukaana haasi haba munyungalala Yeesu, haba musawiila. «Lola! Najyoobe na beena yoobe, badi haayja badi mukukeba.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yeesu haya balunga: «Najyaami ninani, na ba waami mbanani?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Na Yeesu haya lola baba babu yaana haasi na umu nyungalala, haya boya: «Baba i Najyaami na ibawaami! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Umona Yoowa wooso watanga byeebya Kabejya byeelu vula, i muwaami na i Najyaami.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Muele wa mundu wekuna tumuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Nyuma ya bebya, Yeesu bya somba lungi kulangidila bandu mauya ma Kabejya hangondo ha ziba dya Galilaya. Kiandu kikata kya bandu hakya kumaana tonono naye, haaŋo, bya banda na kuyakana munda mwa mutumbu wene haulu ya ziba, na bandu booso haba shaala haŋongo ha meema. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Yeesu bya balangidila mauya mabule mu miele.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:2">Muyeya miele bya balangidila mukusaula: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Muteezye bangu! Lusu lumo, mundu yumo we yena kukunda dyaye muku miana bukuu. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Haŋa henagiye muku miana too tumuka, tumo tumuka hatwaonena hangondo ha zila, tuuni hatwaava na kudya totwa tumuka. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Tungi tumuka hatwaonena haulu hamavu madi na mabu, kwashenange mateke mabule. Hatwamena yayaya kumona kaindi kavane mateke ndakene kakata <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Bobwa hee nana yuba, wowa mutoa hawanyuma kumona mizi ndayeeshwela bileela mu mavu. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Tumuka tungi hatwaonena hamukidi ha meeba, maa meeba hama kula kukumo na too tunuka na kutufinga, ndatweeta bimuka. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Bobwa tungi tumuka hatwahonena kudi mavu maleela. Totwa tumuka hatwamena, hatwakula na kuhaa mitumba. Tumo hatwa haa mitumba makumi masatumasatu, tungi makumi mutubamutuba, na tungi miamia.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Haŋo Yeesu bya boya: «Yowa yidi na makushu makuteejya wa teejye»!<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwakaayi Yeesu uki yakula mu miele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mat 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Haŋa Yeesu henange iye bunga, baba bemunyunganga na baa badingisi baye kumi na babidi haba muyuujya waba fifuludile yeya miele. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Haŋo Yeesu bya basaudila: «Kabejya uva muabila nyinyi kwa kuteejya bidi bufyame bya butangala bwa Kabejya,* ila kudi bandu badi haaza, ngiyakula kila kindu mu miele, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Kwa kuboya ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">‹Balole soo kusidi kumona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Baudikijya, kusidi kuteejye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Kumona bandi fundulukila Kabejya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Na iye wandi bamonena lusa›».<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Isaya 6.9-10</char></note><verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafifulula muele wa mundu we kuna tumuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Haŋo, Yeesu bya saudila bandu: «Ndamukiteezya muele wuuwu? Kwa biibi musamuna bini kuteejya miele yingi? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Tumuka twe kuna yowa mundu, Mauya ma Kabejya. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Tumuka twe hona hangondo ha zila tukifandakana na bandu bamo baki tabukanga mauya ma Kabejya. Akeaŋa, Shetaani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shetani mukibangubangu twamuabila zina dya Shetaani</char></note> waava kuva kuzula mama mauya. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Na totwa tumuka twe honena mu mavu madi na mabu badi bidi bandu bangi baki teejyanga mauya ma Kabejya na kumatabuka na tuseo. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Bobwa ndabakisamanga mauya mate mizi munda mwama tima maabo, baki ma kwatanga kaindi kashoo. Itu baba subisha, au baba yaa kukidila mama mauya ma Kabejya, basama butabuke bwaabo. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Na totwa tumuka twe hona hamukidi ha meeba. Tudi bidi bandu baki teejyanga mauya ma Kabejya, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />Ila minyungonyungo ya muune mukisi, busungu bwa bindu buki bembela, na kalabwa kangi kaki finganga dedya huya, kwa bebya ndatukibutula tumuka. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Na totwa tumuka twe honena mumateke malwela tudi bidi bandu bakiteejyanga mauya ma Kabejya na bamatabuka na babutula bimuka bilwela, bamo babutula bimuka makumi masatu, bangi makumi mutuba, na bangi mia».<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muele wa katoditodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8.16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yeesu bya basaudila lungi: «Mundu uki munikanga katoditodi kwa kufukika na ndamba ao haasi hakalako? Ndabeebyo! Miti tukimunikanga kwaku biika haulu hakiibikilu? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Kwa biibi ndakudi kindu kidi bufiamishibwe kyashakumonekanga hululu, na kyoso kidi muka fyamafyama kiyakananga hululu. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Yidi na makushu makuteejya wateejye!»<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yeesu bya basaudila lungi: «Muyakane na mbambi mumaa mamuki teejya! Kumona kasukijyo kakeekaka kamuki sukijyila bandu bangi, ni kyakekee kimu sukijyila Kabejya; naiye ukijya. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Kwa kumona yowa kiyakananga na kindu ni wabakiabilanga kingi; ila yowa sidi na kindu na kekya kidiye nakyo kikuzudibwanga».<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muele watumuka tukimena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yeesu bya basaudila lungi: «Butangala bwa Kabejya budi bidi mundu yumo we kuna kunda dyaye. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Yowa mundu bufuku we tandabalanga mutulo, munyinya we buukanga, tumuka twamena na twakula naiye ndeeyuka byekidika bini. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Muyuke ti mateke menikindu makimenesha tumuka: Busu kamuka kaata kitombo, kisha kaata mutowa na kumongo kaata bimuka. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Itu bebya bimuka bya monga, mundu wabuula kiyoma kyaye wakatembe, kumona kindi kya kungula kyabambana».<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muele wa tumuka twa haladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mat 13.31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yeesu bya yakula lungi: «Ngikee kindu kikibambana kuyuula butangala bwa Kabejya? Au tubusaule muukee muele? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Boo butangala buki yuudibwa na kamuka ka haladali. Kaki yakananga kashenene kukila tumuka twooso twabaki kuna mukisi. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Ila itu kakunibwa, kakula na ndakate mutoa ukata kukila mitoa yooso ya kunda. Kakitanga matabi makata, na tuuni twaava twaluka maishwa maatwo kukidila mwiziizi waaye.» <verse eid="MRK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yeesu we balangidila mauya ma Kabejya mu miele yingi yabule ya byakee biibi; we balangidila mukitimba kyabe bambana kuteejya. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Nde yakula kindu kwa badi bila kuba teela muele. Nembebya, itu udi na badingisi baye ibo bunga we ba fifuludila kindu kyooso.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa samisha muhee unyumine muziba dya Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Kyolwa kya lwakeeloo lufuku, Yeesu bya saudila badingisi baye: «Tuyabuke mbanga yakabidi ya ziba.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Badingisi baye haba sama kiandu kya bandu haba mubanga Yeesu moo munda mwa mutumbu mwenagiye. Haba somba luendo kwaku yabuka kiziba. Mitumbu yingi yeyabuka kukumo nabo.<verse eid="MRK 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Haŋa na haaŋa hakwa nyomokela muhee unyumine hawa somba kuhumba mutumbu, mabimbi hamasiki kwikasa munda mwamutumbu, mutumbu hawa somba kuyula meema. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Kekya kindi Yeesu wene bu tandabale mutulo kunyuma ya mutumbu bya teela mushu mukihoo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:38">Badingisi baye haba mubuusha na kumusaudila ti: «Mulangidishi! Ndatumota, ndayikikusaudila kindu?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Haŋo, Yeesu bya buuka, bya hanunukila muhee na kusaudila ziba: «Bita nyaa!» Hakeaŋa muhee hawabita, na meema hama talala hakusite nyaa!<verse eid="MRK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Haŋo Yeesu bya yuuzya badingisi baye: «Kwakayi mukitiina? Mbini! Ndamwedi na butabuke?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Baba mitonge haba yudibwa na moyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 4:41">Kwa bebya haba somba kukwiyuzyuzyena hamukidi haabo: «Habanuse! Jyuke mundu yuu, na muhee na ziba byamuteezya»?<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafuula mundu gubwa nangi na misimbusimbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yeesu na mitangi* yaayi haba yabu'a mugela wa bubidi wa Iziba, mu issi kya Wagelasi. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yeesu bobwa bwebu huma ye, mundu mwa mutumbu hanga hanha, yumu gubwa nangi na misimbusimbu gubu huma ubi jyaami; kukuu udi Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Mundu yuugu gubwa nangi mu yaana ubi jyaami, mukyee ihindi kyooso ndobwa nangi mundu gubwa nangi na butangala boo mu ganga muyololo. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Babu mu ganga na muyololo na haba mu ganga na byeela, gubwa nangi mu temba goo wa muyololo na unoŋa byeebya byeela; ndobwa nangi mundu na butananga boo mu kutila. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Mweena lusu, bufu'u na munyinya, gubu yaana ubi jyaami muu kalakala kuu'u na kuu'u mubi banjwa, muu yabaŋana na muu yi bongogola mu tubu. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Bweebu mu mona Yeesu uula, haya weena mu lubilu, haya vunga manyu mabusu gayi. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Na haya dila na mu huuya watagadi na haya boya; «Kyoobe kyaayi kwandi mimi, bebe Yeesu Mwaana wa Kabejya didi hegulu u lububi? Naku haajya mabusu ga Kabejya tii, nangu ni suvya.» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Yuugu mundu gubwa nangi muu sagula biibi, manee Yeesu gubwa nangi muu sawiila musimbusimbu gubwa nangi munda mwaayi; «Huma munda mwa yuugu mundu, beebe muhehe gubigubi!» <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Ihani Yeesu haya mu yuujya yoo mundu: «Zina ndyoobe ni naani?» Na eyu haya mulunga: «Zina dyaami ‹Ngigandu›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Igandu: au Titi dya bandu: Zina diidi dibu teena bungi bwa igandu kya balonga-buvuadi 6000 na bwa babu sagula biibi ngu monesha bungi bwa guugu muhehe gubigubi. </char></note>, manee tuluyaana babutu.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Yugu mundu hekilu yigaya udi Yeesu ti: «Ndijyanganga misimbusimbu ula mukyee Issi».<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Mukyee ibanjwa ubwa nangi muyolo watagadi wa ngulubi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngulubi u Bayahudi bwina nyama buubu bubwa nangi halamu au yibiyibi ukidila diini (Lawi 11.7); na umona kwa muyolo wa ngulubi udi muu monesha tii, babu yaani mu diidi buga ndaba bwa nangi Bayahudi.</char></note> muudya. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Ihani yiiyi misimbusimbu haya mu haajya Yeesu tii, «Utushwejyi munda mwa guugu muyolo wa ngulubi.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Utushweejyi mundu mwa guugu muyolo wa ngulubi: Nda tuluyu'a indu ibu tinda yiiyi misimbusimbu uhaajya ushweela munda mwa ngulubi. Babu vula byga dya mubidi haboobwa ndababu sheeha indu manee ngulubi yooso yibu gulumu'a na uyi taasha mu iziba na yooso ha yoofwa munda mwa meema.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Na Yeesu haya yi tabwiila. Hanga hanha, misimbusimbu haya huma munda mwa yoo mundu na ushweela munda mwa muyolo wa ngulubi. Haya gulumu'a yooso haasi wa lubanjwa na yooso haya yikasha mu Iziba, haya yoofwa. Ngulubi yibwa nangi elufu yi bidi.<figure style="fig" alt="les troupeau des porcs des porcs ses noie dans le lac" file="WA03846b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wad" ref="5.13">Mugyoo wamota mu iziba</figure> <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Ihani, baaba babwa nangi muu dindijya ngulubi haba weena mu lubilu. Haba weena kuu sawiila bandu babwa nangi u moola na baaba babwa nangi u bisogolo. Bandu haba vueya kuu mona biibi bibu ba sawiila baaba babwa nangi muu dindijya ngulubi, bamoni bibu teebwa. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Bandu baaba haba weena udi Yeesu. Haba mona yoowa mundu gubwa nangi na misimbusimbu, wa yaana haasi, wa vuala ngubu na ndidi na nyinyi yilegela. Hababu mona biibi haba telegejya mooyo! <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Baaba booso babu mona biibi byooso bibu fuu'a yuugu mundu gubwa nangi na misimbusimbu na ngulubi, na haba sawiila baaba babu vueya manyuma. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Ihani haba mugaa yidila Yeesu wabagadi mu Issi nyaabu.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Yeesu, eyu mu boya tii wa shweedi munda mwa Mutumbu, mundu yoowa weebu fuula gubwa nangi na misimbusimbu, haya musawila Yeesu tii; tabu'a na kukumbi. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yeesu haya keezema uweena hamonga nayi, haboobwa haya mu sawiila: «Inanga u yendi kyoobe, kwiinu koo butote'a, waaba sawiidi bandu byeebya Kabejya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Vidi-nyambi: ni Kabejya (1.3; 11.9; 12.11,29-30,36; 13.20). Zina dya mbunda Vidi-nyambi, diidi zina balu mu teena Yeesu. Balu mu teena Yeesu biibi koo monesha mbunda na butangala bwa Yeesu. Lola 11.3.</char></note> byeebu ku fuula na uku mweena lusa.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Ihani Yuugu mundu haya weena u dekapoli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dekapoli ni uboya ti, kisi kya mikola kumi</char></note>, haya somba usawiila bindu bya butu bibu muteela Yeesu, na bandu booso haba hanunu'a.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wagalusha buumi udi musi'a gubu fwa na wafuula wa mwaazi gubwa nangi na lufu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Ihani Yeesu haya yabu'a lungi mu mutumbu mugela wa bubidi wa Iziba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mugela wa bubidi wa iziba, i uboya tii, ni mugele wa koo'a ulu sadila yuba wee ziba kya Galilaya.</char></note> kya Galilaya. Koo'a igandu kyatakyata kya bandu hakya mu nyungalala. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Na koo'o, haba heta yumu ngana wa sinagogi*<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mundu yumu gulu vuba munda mwa sinagogi. I ebu babwa nangi na mwambu goo sadisha bandu na u longa sinagogi. Lola Luka 13.14; Mdo 13.15; 18.8, 17.</char></note>, zina dyaayi Yailo, haya fi'a mu kyee'a igandu. Hanha hebu mumona Yeesu, haya vunga manyu babusu gayi. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Yailo haya yi gaaya udi Yeesu, haya boya: «Musi'a waani wa mulengi gudi muukala tuuzi. Nayi gaaya koodi! Fi'a u yende kyaami weene waamu hajyidi, wa fuu'i na wa yani muumi».<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Ihani Yeesu haya weena hamonga nayu. Na kyee'a igandu kyaata hakya mu kumba Yeesu tutuu haba mufinga. <verse eid="MRK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Mu kyee'a igandu ubwa nangi wa mwaazi yumu walufu lwa sangi mu misha umi na yibidi. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Yuugu wa mwaazi gubu suba kwa butu, balu vuba bihonya babutu haba muvuba. Haboobwa dibu fuu'a, haya tula bindu byeebwa nangi nabyu byooso, lufu waayi halwa mu neemena ukila mabusu. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Yuugu wa mwaazi bwebu telegejya tii, Yeesu gudi munda mwa kyee'a igandu, haya shweela na eyu mukyee igandu, haya weena manyuma ga Yeesu, munda mwa kyee igandu, haya kwa lengela ngubu ya Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Manee gubwa nangi musagula munda mwa tima dyaayi: «Itu na lengela ye, ngubu yaayi, na fu'anga».<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Hanga hanha, goowa muloha waayi hawa kama, lufu lwayi looso halwa fuu'a. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Hanga hanha, Yeesu haya yu'a tii, butangala bwayi bwaheela. Haya fululu'a manyuma na haya yujya: «Inani gubu lengela ngubu yaami?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Mitongi yaayi haya musawiila: «Gudi mumona kii'i igandu idi mukufinga, na beebe gudi muyujya tii, ni nani waku lengela?» <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Haboobwa Yeesu hekilu lola gungi mu igandu tii, wamoni yoowa gubuta bibi. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Habobwa, yoowa wamwaazi hekilu zeeza na utelegejya mooyo na uyu'a byeebya byamufi'ila, haya weena, haya kwahona u magulu ga Yeesu, haya mu sawiila hululu bye byooso bibukila. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Ihani Yeesu haya mu sawiila: «Musi'a waami ulungidila koobe kwandi mimi kwa kufuula. Inanga bilegela na lufu loobe lwafu'i!» <verse eid="MRK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Gubwa nangi ndikyewa usagula, bandu babu vueya uhumina u yende kyayi habafi'a. Haba mu sawiila Yailo: «Musi'a woobe wakala tima! Sama umu suvya mulangidijyi?» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Yeesu gubu telegejya byeebya bya babwa nangi mu sagula ndibu bikumba na haya mu sawiila Yailo: «Nangutina, lungidila ye.» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yeesu ndibu vula gungi tii, baaba bandu booso bamu kumbi, ila ye Petelo, Yakobo na Yohane muwaayi na Yakobo.<verse eid="MRK 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Haba bufi'a kwa Yailo, Yeesu haya kwa heta vunda na bandu badi muu yabaŋana na mudila. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Yeesu haya shweela munda mwa yende na haya ba sawiila: «Diidi vunda dyooso dyamudi muuta ndya ayi? Kyamudi muudila ngyaayi? Musi'a yuugu ndi kyee mota; wanoko'a mutulu ye.» <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ihani bandu babwa nangi munda mwa yende haba kilu museha Yeesu! Yeesu haya balosha booso hajya, haya bugula shaayi na musi'a na najyaayi na musi'a, na baba bebu vueya nabu, haba shweela u buga ndya babu mubii'a musi'a, <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yeesu haya waata musi'a kuu bo'o na haya musawiila: «Talitha koum!» I uboya tii: «Musi'a mushoo, naku sawiila, talu'a»!<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Hanga hanha, yoowa musi'a haya talu'a na hekilu sumu'a. Musi'a gubwa nangi na misha umi na yibidi. Na bandu booso bwababu mona bibi haba hanunu'a. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yeesu haya ba nyajya tii, ndaba sawiilanga mundu nangi yumu huya didi. Ihani haya basawiila tii, bamu gabidi yugu musi'a biyazi waadi.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Bandu ba Nazaleti ndabaki tabuka Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yeesu we nyomoka mudye bua bya yena mu mukola kokwa kwe kudileeye, mitonge baaye be yena naye. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Halwe bambana lusu lwa Sabato*, bya somba kulangidila bandu munda mwa sinagogi. Bandu babule be muteejyanga haba hanunuka na kuboya ti: «Nguni kwa vukileye bii byoso? Njyuni wamwabila yiyi nyinyi na butangala bwa kuta bindu bikataadi? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Be, yuhu nda yuhu kiluka byende, mwana wa Malia, na mukwaye na Yakobo na Yose na Yuda na Simoni? Na batabwaye ndabaki yakana hakehaaŋa hiitu?» Kwabebya haba kushwa kumutabuka.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Haŋo, Yeesu bya basaudila: «Musauzi* wa Kabejya ukitumbibwa mabua mooso, alaa mu kisi kye butukeye, kilongo kyaye na kyende kyaye.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yeesu ndeeta lungi kingulu ngulu, ila we hibika biboko haulu habamo bandu bene na lufu na kuba fuula. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Bya hanunuka na kukushwa kwa butabuke bwa bandu ba mukola waaye.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Yeesu wayiisha mitonge yaye kumi na babidi</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Nyuma ya haŋo, Yeesu bya sumukila mikola yooso ya mumangondo kulangidila bandu. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Haŋo bya taana mitonge baaye kumi na babidi, bya somba kuba yiisha babidibabidi. Byaba habila butangala bwa kuzyanga mizuka; <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8-9" />haya bakwata kumakushu na kuboya: «Ndamubuula kindu hamwenanga ila bobo kikooma; ndamubuula mukati, nee taba dyaluendo, wala falanga mumbote yiinu. Mutubile makubaati kubidimba, ila ndamushwaala ngubu yibidi».<verse eid="MRK 6:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Yeesu haya basaudila lungi ti: «Bua dyooso dyabi batabuka mukyende, muyakane momwa mupaka beebya byamu hezela muwowa mukola. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Itu bandu baumo mukola babenga kuba tabuka ao kumuteejya, muezele mudye bua. Na mukukumune mateke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kukumuna mateke, ngumonesha ti badingisi ndabadi na kiyo kya kusaula mauya ma Kabejya mu wowa mukola</char></note> mabidimba biinu: Yiyakana kumanyiibwa kwabadi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Haŋo, mitonge baye kumi na babidi haba yena, kuka saula mauya ma Kabejya kubandu booso ti baki bambana kufundulula buyakane bwaabo. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Be jyanga mizuka yabule na kufuula bandu babule beene na lufu mu kuba lalabisha maani.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumota kwa Yohane luyabikana mu meema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Haŋo, kolo Heloode we teezya musau wa Yeesu, kumona longo dyaye dye bambana mabua mooso. Bamo be boya ti: «Yohane luyabikana mumeema wa tundumuka! Ni bobwa udi na butangala bwa kuta bingulungulu.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Bobwa, bangi bandu be boya ti: «Ni Elia.» Bangi lungi haba boya: «Yuhu Musauzi wa Kabejya, bidi yumo Musauzi mukulukulu». <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Haŋa heva teejya Helode wowa musau bya yakula ti: «Ni Yohane luyabikana mumeema! Wambee tembesha mushu, ila watundumuka!»<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Nembebya, Helode we hana kilau kyaku kwaata Yoane na kumuzitika, buangibwe mikulu ya byuma. Yene kukidila Helodia, wee tundula Helode nembe bye nangiye mukazi wa mukwaye Fidipo. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Kumona Yoane we saudila Helode ti: «Ndayiki bambana kwoobe kubuula mukazi wa mukwoobe!» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Haŋo, Helodia bya mukwatila Yoane kiizi na kuvula kumuya, ila nde samuna, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Kumona, Helode we tiina Yoane. Kumona we yukanga ti wene mundu yidi buludi na usidi na bubi, we mukungulula. Haŋa he muteejyeye, bya beleka kabisa, wala we vula kumuteejya.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Nibobwa, hakwa moneka zila kudi Helodia lusu lwa kusehelela kubutuka kwa Helode. Helodia bya loba bandu babutangala bwaye, bakulu ba balonga-buvadi na bakulu bamikola ya Galilaya.<verse eid="MRK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Musika wa Helodia bya shwela mudye bua na kusemba; Helode bya seelela na baini baaye. Kolo bya saudila yowa musika: «Nguazye kindu kyooso kyaukivula, ni kwabilekyo.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Na bya musaudila kwa kumulapila ti: «Ngilapa kyooso kyauhazya nikwabila, nee luba lwa butangala bwaami.»<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Musika bya nyomoka na kuzyongondela nazye: «Naajye kaayi?» Najye bya mujyongodela ti: «Mushu wa Yohane luyabikana mumeema.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Musika bya haluka yayaya kudi Kolo na kumu saudila ti: «Ngiazya ungwabile akeano mushu wa Yoane haulu hasinia!» <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Kolo bya mona susu; bobwa ndevula kumubengela, kukidila kilapo kyeteeye busu bwa baini baye. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Hakeaŋa, Kolo bya tuma yumo mulonga-buvadi muba baki mudindikijya, na mulao wakuvisha mushu wa Yoane. Mulonga-buvadi bya yena ku zitikilu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zitikilu ni bua dyakuzitikila bandu ao kafwalubi</char></note> na kuka temba mushu wa Yohane. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Haŋo bya visha mushu haulu ha sinia na kumwabila yowa musika, yowa musika naaye bya habila najye.<verse eid="MRK 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Haŋa badingisi ba Yohane habee teejya wowa musau, habaava kuvabuula kitumba kyaaye na kukaziika kumufungu.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wadisha bandu elufu yitano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Baba mitonge* haba haluka kudi Yeesu na kumusaudila byooso bya beeta na kulangidila. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Bobwa, bandu beyena na beviyanga bene babule bobwa Yeesu na badingisi baye nda beene nee kindi kyakudya bidyazi. Nibobwa haya basaudila: «Twene mubua disidi bandu tukaume kamo kaindi.»  <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Haba yena hibo bunga mu mutumbu, mubua disidi bandu. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Bobwa bandu babule be bamona ibokweyena na haba yuka kwa benanga; haba yena kabilo mikola yooso na bidimba na kusosoka mudedya bua busu bwa Yeesu na badingisi baye. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Haŋa heeva sala Yeesu mu mutumbu, haya mona kiandu kikata kya bandu, byaba fiila lusa, kumona benee bushwa mikooko yisidi na mulolezi, bya somba kuba langidila bindu bya bule.<verse eid="MRK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Yene ndayite kyoolwa, haŋo badingisi baaye haba muyila Yeesu na kumusaudila ti: «Ndayite nyuma na diino bua ni lungu. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Mbilweela usaudile baa bandu ba yeene kuma kunda na kumikola yidi tonono bakakwi udile bya kudya.» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Haŋo Yeesu byaba saudila: «Banyu benikindu mubaabile bidyaazi!» Naibo haba muyuujya: «Haŋo! Ukivula twene tukaule mikate ya dinadi mia yibidi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinadi mia yibidi: Ni falanga ya kuabila muvubi mu miango kitemaa</char></note> na tubaabile baadye»?<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yeesu bya basaudila: «Mudi na mikate yinga? Mweene muka lole.» Habeewa kumona haba musaudila ti: «Tudi na mikate yitano, na bibelelo bibidi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Haŋo, Yeesu bya basaudila ba yakanishe bandu booso haasi musunyi byandubyandu. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Bandu haba yakana mu byandu bya mia na bya makumi matano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Haŋo Yeesu bya buula yeya mikati yitano na bebya bibelelo bibidi, bya lola haulu na kufiyudila, bya bela yeya mikati na kuabila mitonge baye bayi habe kudi bandu. Na bebya bibelelo bibidi naabyo bya biaba kudi bandu booso. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Bandu bya baadya booso byaba shiba. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Badingisi haba tondola makobwa mabindi bya mikati na bibelelo bye shaala, byooso habya yula taba kumi na yibidi. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Na baba beedya yeya mikate bene bandu helufu yitano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wasumuka haulu ha meema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoh 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Akeaŋa, Yeesu bya saudila badingisi baye ba bande mutumbu, bakwi tondokele busu bwaye mbanga ya kabidi yaziba dya Galilaya ku yelekela ku kisi kya Betesaida, mukekya kindi iye wene mukulaa kiandu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Nyuma yaku balaa bya yena kukituulu kimo kuka hajya Kabejya.<verse eid="MRK 6:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Haŋa hayisite kyoolwa, mutumbu wene ndaute hamukidi haziba na Yeesu wene iye bunga kuaŋongo. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Haŋa hemoneye ti badingisi baaye basuba kwabule kwa kuyisha mutumbu kumbala, kumona mwee wene mukuhumba kwabadi; haŋa tonono na bufuku kukya, Yeesu bya yena kwabadi kusumuka haulu ha meema, na bya vula kuba kila. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Haŋa habe mumona mukusumuka haulu ha meema, haba yaba haba nizya ti muzuka. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Kumona, booso bemumona haba teezya moyo. Akeaŋa, Yeesu bya yakula nabo: «Muhuume, ndamutiina ŋjyami!»  <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Haŋo, bya banda mu mutumbu mwabeenange, na mwee hawa sama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:51">Naibo haba hanunuka kabisa. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Kumona ndabe yuka ngingu ya yeya mikati: Nganyi yabo yene yinemaneema.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafuula badi na lufu ku kisi kya Genezaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Habeewa kuyabuka ziba ndabate mbanga ya Genezaleti haba tukama. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Habe nyomoka mu mashua, akeaŋa bandu haba muyuka Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Bandu haba yena kabilo mu mikola yooso haba siki muvishila baa badi na lufu haulu ha tulako twaabo, haba bashwala bua dyooso dyabe teejya ti Yeesu udi kwakale. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Bua dyoso dye yena Yeesu, ku mikola yikata, ku mikola yishenene ao kuma kunda, bandu bebika badi na lufu mu byambala na kukwi haya na Yeesu ti ba lengele nee ni subi yangubu yaye. Na baa booso be mulengela be fuuka.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Mahuya ga Kabejya na mahuya ga butusigila bashiitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-20">Mat 15.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Lusu lumu Bafalisayo* na bamu Balangidijyi ba buta babu humina u Jeluzalema haba ganda mabusu ga Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Haba mona mitongi yimu ya Yeesu muudya biyaazi na minyu yidi na ifufu i, uboya tii, ndababu tumba minyu bilu boya bwaama bwaabu. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Babu boya biibi, manee Bafalisayo na Bayuda booso ndaba ludya mupaka utumba mobo'o bilegela byeebya bibu balaga ba shaabu. Kyee'a ilagu nda'ibu vula mundu udya bila utumba minyu bilegela. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Na'ishu bagalu'a kwijyumbidilu, mabusu ga udya mupaka ba tumbi mabo'o. Na babwa nangi na bilagu bingi bya butu byaba bwa nangi muuta; bidi utumba ngata, milondo, ngolo na bi teelu bingi bya byababu longa na shaba. <verse eid="MRK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Ihani bafalisayo na Balangidijyi ba Sambu* haba mu yujya Yeesu: «Kwa ayi mitongi yoobi badi muyatiyila bilagu bya ba shiitu, na mona byeebya bya badi muudya na minyu ya ifufu?» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yeesu haya balunga: «Banyu mudi na ngenu! Mubushi Isaya gubu sagula unindu hebu mi teela asa'u, heebu sinya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‹Bandu baaba badi muu nineemesha na minomo yaabu ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">haboobwa matima gaabu galukaana ula naami.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Uni haajya kwaabu ngwa busadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">Na ndangijyu yaabu yilu yaana ndangijyu ya bandu yega<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Isaya 29:13</char></note>.›<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Yeesu byabayaka ti: Banyu mulusama bilagu bya Kabejya na mwa kumba buyaani bwa bandu».<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Na gungi haya ba salwiila: «Banyu mulu yananga ba helahela usama bilagu bya Kabejya manee mulu kumba buyaani bwiinu! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Miti, mu luyu'a byeebya Musa byeebu sagula: ‹Tiina shoobe na najyoobe.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Kunyomoka 20.12, 21.17; Balawi 20.9; Kumb 5:16</char></note> Na haya boya lungi: ‹Yoowa wooso wa kayanga shaayi au najyaayi, wamote.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Kunyomoka 20.12, 21.1; Walawi 20.9; Kuejya 5.16</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Banyu mulu sagulanga ti: ‹Itu mundu udi nakindu kyandi bambana kunyangujya shaye ao najye, ila bya yakula ti kiiki kindu ni kyambivavula kukuabila ni kolobani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kolobani, iuboya tii, nayituula udi Kabejya.</char></note>› (Ngu boya ti: na yituula kudi Kabejya). <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Uta biibi ngu boya tii, mulu sawiila mundu ndi teelanga shaayi ao najyaayi umu yangula. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Usagula biibi, mwa taasha hangondo mahuuya ga Kabejya ukidila ndangijyu ya ba shiinu muulu, ya mudi muulula. Na mudi muuta bingi bindu byabutu bilu fwandana na biibi».<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bindu bilubii'a mundu na bubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15.10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Ihani Yeesu haya taŋana lungi igandu kya bandu na uba sawiila: «Banyu booso muni telegejyi bilegela na muyu'i kwa unindu biibi byandi mumi sawiila bilu boya ayi:  <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Ndaudi indu ilu shweela munda mwa mundu na umuta bubi. Haboobwa ni bindu bilu huma munda mwa mundu i bilu muta bubi. [<verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Yoowa gudi na moosho goo telegejya watelegejye!»] <verse eid="MRK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Haŋa Yeesu heebu huma mu igandu na ugalu'a u yende, ndingisi* yaayi haya mu yuujya tii, guugu muele gulu boya bini. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Yeesu haya basa wiila: «Banyu neebu, nda mudi na nyinyi? Nda muluyu'a indu nangi imu ilushweela munda mwa mundu na umuta bubi? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Manee ndabilushweela munda mwa tima. Haboobwa ebyu bilushweela munda mwa ifu na uhuma lungi munda mwa mubidi waayi na uweena ilu.» Ukidila buubu busagudi, Yeesu gubu vula usagula tii, biyaazi byooso mbilegela udiibwa.<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Yeesu haya boyalungi: «Ni indu ilu huma munda mwa mundu i ilu muta mundu bubi. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Manee migejyu yibiyibi yilu huma munda mwa tima dya mundu i yi lumuta bubi, na ufila mundu uta: Masenga, wiiba, uhega<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Loma 1.31 gumone bindu bilu nyaajyibwa uta.</char></note> bandu, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />masenga, afyuulu, tima dibidibi, majyindi, uta bindu bishidi mu buludi, ngenu, ugambijyeena, uyimona, uluba nyinyi. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Biibi byooso bindu bibibibi i bilu huma u tima dya mundu na umubii'a mundu na bubi».<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa mwaazi gushidi muyuda wamu tabu'a Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Biibi ukila, Yeesu haya huma hanha haya weena mugela gungi nena na moola wa Tilo. Koo'a, haya kwashweela mu yendi imu mwijyeejyi. Haboobwa ndibu vula bandu uyu'a ti, gudi hanha. Habobwa ndibu samuna ufwaama mabusu ga bandu.<verse eid="MRK 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Biibi muukila, wa mwaazi yumu gubwa nangi na musi'a waayi na muhehe gubigubi haya telejya woowa mwiizi guhyaguhya wa Yeesu, hani haya vueye na haya hulu'a u mgulu ga Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Yuugu wa mwaazi ndibwa nangi muyuda gubwa nangi mu mugiliki, gubutote'a mu Foiniki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Butote'a mu Silofoinike: Silofoinike ni buga nena na moola waba Lumi ba Silia. </char></note> mu isi shamu. Habobwa hekilu yigaya udi Yeesu, wazyangu muhehe gubigubi wabagadi munda mwamusi'a waayi.<verse eid="MRK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Ihani Yeesu haya musawiila: «Sama bangu baana baadi biyaazi na uyuuta. Manee nda bilegela ubugula biyaazi bya baana na utashila mbooze.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biyaazi bya baana ubi gabila: Ba yahudi bangi mu kii'i</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Haboobwa wa mwaazi haya mu lunga: «Kabejya, nangi ngu boya tii ngu nindu, na imbwa na eyu yi ludya makombo galu hulu'a haasi heegulu wa ihibiilu haludya baana biyaazi.» <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Ihani Yeesu haya mulunga: «Ukidila biibi byawa nilunga, galusha u yende kyoobe. Goowa muhehe gubigubi wabagala adi munda mwa musi'a woobe.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Ihani yuugu wa mwaazi haya galu'a u yendi kyaayi, haya heta musi'a waayi muladi heegulu wa bulalu. Muhehe gubigubi gubwa nangi walozo'a munda mwaayi.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafuula mundu shilu telegejya na usagula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Biibi ukila, Yeesu haya bagala mu iba ibwa nangi mugela wa Tilo, haya kila mu bwaata bwa Sidona na Dekapoli, na haya weena hangondo wa iziba kya Galilaya. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Koo'a haba mu vuishila mundu shilu telegejya hamonga na buhala, na haba mu gaayidila Yeesu ti, wamu hibiidi mabo'o na wamu fuudi. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Ihani Yeesu haya mu fufula haajya wa igandu, haba sheena hangondo. Haya shweejya minyu yaayi munda mwa moosho gaayi, haya fiila mata na haya leengala ludimi lwaayi. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Ihani haya tungula meesu hegulu, haya saguha na muhuuya watagadi na uboya «Effata!» I usagula biibi: «Yuuzulu'a beebe!» <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Ihindi nangu lowa, moosho ga yuugu mundu haga gangu'a na ludimi lwaayi halwa namu'a, na heekidi sagula bilegele.<verse eid="MRK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yeesu haya ba sawiila baba booso babwa nangi hanha ndaba sawilanga mundu nangi yumu biibi bibu teebwa. Haboobwa bandu ndababu telegejya haba sagula guugu mwiizi <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Baaba bandu babu teleghejya guugu mwiizi, babu haanunu'a unindu na haba boya: «Byooso Yeesu byeedi muuta mbilegela! Wa tegeshesha bandu badi na moosho ga zimbani na u sawiisha bifuma»!<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa disha bandu elufu mia yinaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Mu maama masu, kiandu kikata kya bandu hakya kumaana lungi kudi Yeesu. Kumona ndabeene na kindu kya kudya, Yeesu bya taana badingisi baaye na kuba jyongodela: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Na monena lusa kiiki kiandu kya bandu. Kumona yaata mafuku masatu badi kukumo naami na ndabadi lungi na byakudya. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Itu na balaa ba yeene kwaabo ibo na zala, bi lebela na kuona muzila. Kumona bamo hamukidi haabo beeva kulakula».<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Badingisi baaye haba mujyongodela ti: «Mudiino bua dya lungu tumonena kuni bidyazi byabule byaku badisha?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yeesu bya bayuzya: «Mudi na mikati yinga?» Haba yaka ti: «Tudi na mikati musamboo».<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Haŋo Yeesu bya saudila bandu ba yakane haasi. Bya buula yeya mikati musombo na kuboya abee kudi Kabejya. Haŋo bya yibela na kuyiabila badingisi baye kwakuyi habanyina bandu. Badingisi baaye haba baabanyina. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Benange byakebee na bibelelo bishee. Yeesu bya hajya ti Kabejya wafiyudile bebya bibelelo. Na kusaudila mitonge baaye bahabanye byakebee. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Haŋo bandu booso ha baadya na kushiba na badingisi baaye haba tondola bindi byeshaala na kuyuzya taba musamboo. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Bandu beedya bebya bidyaazi bene hangi elufu yinaa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:9">Kisha Yeesu bya balaa baaluke. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Akeaŋa, bya banda mu mashua kukumo na mitonge baaye, na byaba yena mukisi kya Dalmanutha.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bafalisayo baajya Yeesu wabatele kimo kingulungulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12.38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Bamo Bafalisayo habaava kudi Yeesu na kusomba kutambaka naye. Bevula kumutea. Haŋo haba muajya waba teele kingulungulu kimo kya kumonesha ti butangala bwaye bwa nyomokela haulu. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yeesu bya mona susu mutima dyaye na kuboya: «Kwakayi bandu bamaanu masu bakikeba kimo kingulungulu? Ngibasaudila ti kwa kwinikindu, ndaba kuebwa kingulungulu neekimo»!<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Haŋo Yeesu bya basama, bya banda mu mashua, na kuyabuka mweela wakabidi wa ziba.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Haisho dya Mafalisayo na dya Helode</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16.5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Badingisi baaye beluba kubuula mikati ya luendo. Benange na mukati huumo bobo mu mutumbu. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yeesu bya bamanya na kuboya: «Mukwikengeyele na haisho dya Bafalisayo na dedya dya Helode».<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Haŋo mitonge baye habasikita mbaka ibo kwaibo, na kuboya ti: «Wa yakula beebya kumona ndatudi na mikati».<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Iye Yeesu bya yuka mbaka yaabo, kwa bebya bya bayuuzya: «Kwakaayi mukita mbaka ti ndamudi na mikati? Mbini ndamwe teejya bilweela wala ndamweyuka? Mbini! Matima miinu makidi manyumine? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Mudi na meeso buune ndamukimona? Mudi na makushu ila ndamukiteejya? Ndamukiejya lungi: <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />ti haŋa hambeebela yeya mikati yitano ya kushibisha bandu helufu yitano? Ndamba yinga yamwe yuza makombwa?» Haba muyaka ti: «Ndamba kumi nayibidi.» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Bya bayujya lungi: «Haŋa hambee bela yeya mikati musambo yakushibisha bandu helufu yinaa, mweyujya ndamba yinga ya bindi bya mweetondola bya makombwa?» Haba yaka ti: «Musamboo.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Haŋo Yeesu bya bayujya: «Manee nabiino ndamweteejya bobo»?<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafuula mukufu yumo ku Bethesaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Haŋo Yeesu na mitonge baye habe sosoka mu mukola wa Betesaida. Haŋa, bandu haba muvishila Yeesu mundu yumo yidi mukufu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mukufu mundu yidi bubeleke meeso</char></note> na haba kwi haya na Yeesu wamulengele kuboya ti wamufuule. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yeesu bya kwata kiboko kya yowa mukufu na kuyena naye haaza hamukola. Kisha bya fiila mata ku meeso ma yowa mukufu na kumuibikila kiboko na kumu yuujya, «Ukimona kimo kindu?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Yowa mukufu byalola na kuzyongola ti: «Ngimona bandu, ila ngibamona bidi miti yiki sumuuka.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yeesu bya hibika lungi biboko ku meeso mayowa mundu. Yowa mundu bya fuuka na bya somba kumona bindu byooso bilweela. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Haŋo Yeesu bya mulaa wayene kwaye na kumuzyongodela: «Nee mumukola ndualuka lungi».<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo wayakula hululu ti Yeesu udi Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Nyuma ya haŋa, Yeesu na badingisi baaye haba hezela mudye bua haba yena mumikola yikinyunga mukola wa Kaisalia Filipi. Habenange muzila, Yeesu bya yuuzya badingisi baye: «Bandu bakiboya ti miimi ni naani?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Haba muyaka ti: «Bamo bandu bakiboya ti udi Yohane Luyabikana mumeema, bangi baki boya ti udi Elia. Bangi lungi baki boya ti udi yumo wa basauzi ba Kabejya».<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Yeesu wa yuujya lungi badingisi baye: «Ko! Banyu, muki yakula mimi mbidi naani?» Petelo bya yaka: «Beebe udi Kilisito!» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yeesu bya balanga kushu minyee ti ndabasaudila mundu wowa mukizi waaye.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wayakula kukidila kumota na kufukuka kwaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16.21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Haŋo, Yeesu bya somba kulangidila badingisi baye bibi: «Mimi Mwana wa Mundu ngibambana kusuba kwabule, na kubengebwa na banunu, na bamupelo bakata na balangidishi ba buta*. Na mongo ya haaŋo binguyaisha ila kisha mafuku masatu ni fukuka.» <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Yeesu webasaudila maa mooso hululu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:32">Haŋo Petelo bya mubuula hangondo na bya somba kumu kandila kukidila mauya maaye. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ila Yeesu bya funduluka na kulola kudi badingisi baaye, kisha bya hanunukila Petelo na kumu zyongodela: «Hezela, haluka nyuma yaami Shetaani! Kumona miejyo yoobe ndayidi bidi miejyo ya Kabejya. Ila ukiheejya bikiheezya bandu»!<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Haŋo Yeesu bya taana kiandu kyabandu kukumo na badingisi baaye na kubasaudila: «Itu yumo wavula kuva kwambidi, wa kwibenge iye mwinikindu, wakwi tulule musalaba waaye na wave kwambidi. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Kumona mundu wooso kivula kufuula mwejyo waaye uuzizimishanga. Ila yowa wooso yizizimishanga mwejyo waye kukidila miimi na kukidila mauya malweela, uufulanga. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Yi nyangujya mundu kaayi itu wavuka bindu byooso bya muune mu musenge, na kuzizimisha mwejyo waye? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Ao ngike kindu kihaana mundu kwa kuula mwejyo waye?<verse eid="MRK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Muyuke ti bandu baleelo badi na bubi na ndabaki tabuka ka Kabejya. Kukidila bebya itu mundu wangu ndeejyela miimi buuvu na kuteejyela mauya maami busu bwaba bandu miimi Mwaana wa Mundu niba teejyela buuvu hambivanga mubutangala bwa Shami kukumo na ba Malaika baami balweela».<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa fundululu'a lwebu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Ihani Yeesu haya basalwila: «Unindu namisawila, udi bamu baandu batebami hamonga niishu hanu babumonanga butangala bwa Kabejya mabusu ha ebu kumota».<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa fundulujya lukebo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Ukila masu mutubaa, Yeesu haya buhula, Petelo, na Yakobo na Yohana, haya babuhula haya banda nabu hegulu wa ibanjwa ila. Ko'a, lwebu lwa Yeesu halwafundulu'a <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Ngubu yayi hayikidi yito'a to'a peepeepee, na uto'a unindu ukila bandu kalunga badi hanu haasi wa yuba byebya byabalutosha ngubu. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Ihindi na ngulowa, Eliya na Musa tutuu mabusu hayi, habakiluta luhumbu hamonga na Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petelo bya saudila Yeesu ti: «Mulangidishi, mbileela bashu kuyakana haŋa. Buune, mbileela tuluke bisoso bisatu: kimo kyoobe, kingi kya Musa na kingi kya Eliya.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Petelo na bezinaye habakushwa kyakuyakula kumona betiina kwabule. Haŋo petelo byasaudila Yeesu ti: Mulangidishi, mbileela tuyakane haŋa, tuluke bisoso bisatu: kimo kiyakana kyobe na kingi kiyakana kya Musa na kingi kya Elia. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Ihani timba hadyahuma na hadya babwila mulembela. Na muhuya hawahuma munda mwa timba na uboya: «Yuhu ni mwaana waami wanduvula kwa butu. Mumutelehejyi eyu!» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Hangahaŋa, habalola hangondu waabu, ndabumona mundu yungi ha Yeesu halaa.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Mukyee'a ihindi kyababwa nangi musala hehulu wa ibanjwa, Yeesu haya banyaya ti, ndabasawilanga mundu nangi yumu byebya byababumona, badindidi lusu Mwaana wa Mundu lwayafukukanga munda mwa baba babumota. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Ihani habayana nyaa. Habakiluyiyujya munda mwabu: «Biibi byatwamona bidi muvula uboya bini ‹kufukuka munda mwa bamote?›».<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Ibobwa habamuyujya Yeesu: «Ngyayi balangidijyi ba mahuya holulu kyabadi musawila ti, Eliya i wavueyanga mabusu ga Masiya?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yeesu haya balunga: «Ngunindu ti, Eliya wavueyanga mabusu kulonga bindu byooso byayani biyabiya. Habobwa ngyayi Mahuya ha Kabejya kyahadi musawila na ehu ti, mbilehela ti, Mwaana wa Mundu wasubanga kwabutu, na umukezema? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Mimi namisawila: Eliya hubuvueya bubululu. Habamutela byebya byooso bibusinyibwa ti, bamatelanga, byebya byabibusinyibwa mu Mahuya ha Kabejya».<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wafula genda hubwanangi na mu musimbusimbu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-20">Mat 17.14-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:37-43">Luk 19.37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Haŋa Yeesu na Petelo na Yakobo na Yohana hababufi'a ko'a ubwanangi mitakibwa yingi, habomona ihandu kyatakyata kya bandu kyabanyungalala na ndangijyi ya mahu golulu ebu musindaŋana nabu. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Hangahaha bobwa bandu booso bwababumumona Yeesu, haba hanunu'a haba wena mulubilu haba muyambidila. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yeesu haya yuzya mitakibwa yayi: «Mudi musindaŋana nabu u ayi?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Ihaŋa mundu yumu mukyee igandu hayalunga: «Mulangidijyi, namuvwisha kodi bebe. Manee gudi na musimbusimbu wamuta buhala. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Na musimbusimbu gulumubanda bihindi byooso, umutasha mu mavu, luta mumuhuma mwanya, uyisuma meeno na wanyana. Handahajya badingisi boobe bajyangi musimbusimbu, haba kushwa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Ibobwa Yeesu haya balunga: «Banyu, bandu baleelo bashidi na ulungidila, nayani ninu masu ganga? Masu bungi ganda midindila tii, mulongamani? Munivuishidi yughu gende kwandidi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Ihani habamuvuisha. Bobwa ye, Musimbusimbu bwahubumumona Yeesu, hawamutenga mwana kwa butu. Mwana haya hona mu mavu, hekilugalagala, na luta halukilu huma mukwanywa kwayi. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yeesu haya muyuzya shayi: «Nda udi masu ganga gekidi na musimbusimbu?» Shayi haya mulunga ti: «Usomba utote'a kwayi. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Mwena lusu, musimbusimbu yilumutasha u mudilu, mumema mukeba umuhega. Habobwa ishu wavula, utumonene lusa gutu fuudi!» <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Habobwa Yeesu haya musawila: «Waboya ti, ishu navula! Bindu byooso mbihelahela udi mundu gululungidila udi Kabejya.» <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Hangahaha, shayi na mwana haya tungula muhuya haya boya: «Na lungidila! Habobwa uniludi'i, manee ulungidila kwami ngushu!»<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Haŋa Yeesu hebumona igandu kyavueya kukuu, kwabadi, haya taŋanywina musimbusimbu, haya musawila: «Bebe musimbusibu wa buhala na shilutelegejya, mimi nakusawila, huma munda mwayugu mwaana bwangabuni, koko nangushwela gungi munda mwayi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Haaŋo wowa muzuka hawatumba muuya, na kuzezesha yoowa mwaana binyumiine na kunyomoka munda mwaye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:26">Ni yowa mwaana bya yakana bidi mundu mumote; haaŋo bandu babule kisha kumona beebya haba sikiyakula ti: «Wamota!» <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Haŋo Yeesu bya mukwata kukiboko, na kumutalusha, naiye bya taluka mushuteba.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Haaŋa he shwela Yeesu mukyende, badingisi baaye haba muyuuzya habeene ibobunga, «Mbikayi baashu ndatuvasamuna kuboosha yiiyi mizuka?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yeesu bya bayaka: «Mizuka ya biibi yiki bozokanga bobo kwa kuajya».<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wayakula lungi kukidila kumota na kufukuka kwaaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Yeesu na badingisi baye haba hezela kokwa, haba kidila mu kisi kya Galilaaya. Haŋo Yeesu ndee vula mundu neeyumo wayuke bua dya beenange. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Kumona wene mukulangidila badingisi baaye na kubasaudila: «Miimi Mwaana wa Mundu nitudibwa mubi boko bya bandu naibo binguyaa; nembebya lufuku lwa kasatu ni zikuka.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Nembebya badingisi* ndabee yuka dedyo huya dye yakula Yeesu. Ibo haba tiina kumu yuuza.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zyuke mundu yidi mukulu?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Haŋo Yeesu na badingisi* baye haba shwela mu mukola wa Kapelenaumu. Haŋa habe shwela mukyende, Yeesu bya bayuuzya: «Muvane mukuingana kukidila kayi muzila?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Haŋo ndabee yaka kindu, kumona muzila beene mukuingana ibo kwa ibo ti bayuka itu ninaani yidi mukulu hamukidi haabo.<verse eid="MRK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Haŋo Yeesu bya yakana haasi, bya bataana baa mitonge baye kumi na babidi na kuba saudila: «Itu mundu wooso ukivula kuyakana wabusu hamukidi ha bandu, ukibambana kukwita wamongo yabooso na muvubi wa booso».<verse eid="MRK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Haŋo Yeesu bya buula mwaana muteenene na kumubiika hamukidi haabo. Bya muyambitila, kisha bya basaudila: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Mundu wooso kitabuka kwaaye mwana muteenene bidi yuu muzina dyaami, wangundabuka miimi. Na mundu wooso kingundabuka miimi nda miimi kitabukeye ila watabuka yowa wenguyiisha».<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu yungi kishejya mizuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9.49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Haŋo Yohane bya saudila Yeesu ti: «Mulangidishi twamona mundu ukizyanga mizuka muzina dyoobe, ila baashu hatwa mubengela, kumona iye ndadi yumo hamukidi hiitu».<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yeesu bya yaka: «Ndamumubengela lungi. Kumona ndakudi mundu kita kingulungulu muzina dyaami na kaindi kukila wayakule bibibibi kwambidi. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Kumona yowa wooso sidi mulwishi wiitu udi mwajyo wiitu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Ngimusaudila bya kwinikindu: Mundu wooso yimuabila mubungu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mubungu ni kopo dya nyoo diitu</char></note> wa meema ma kukubila, kumona ti mudi bandu ba Kilisito,* kwa kwinikindu ndakukushwa sabwidi yaaye.»<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bikishwejya mundu mu bubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18.6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Itu mundu wooso waoneshesha yuu yumo mwana mubaa basheenene bakingundabuka miimi kuta bubi, yandiyakana bilweela kwayuu mundu kuangibwa ibwe dikata musingo dyaye, na kukasibwa muziba.<verse eid="MRK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Itu kiboko kyoobe kyaku humba kuta bubi, ukitembe! Kumona mbilweela kwaudi kushwela mubua dyamwejyo na kiboko kikimo, kusidi kuyakana na biboko bibidi na kushwela muziba dya mudilo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:43">[<verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Bua dedya disikimota bivinyu byaye wala mudilo waaye ndauki zimika.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Na itu kidimba kyoobe kyaku vishila kuta bubi, ukitembe! Kumona mbilweela kwoobe kushwela mubua dyamwejyo udi na kidimba kikimo, kusidi kuyakana na bindimba bibidi na ukashwele muziba dyamudilo. [<verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Buwa didi bivinyu byaaye ndabikimota wala mudilo waaye ndauki zimika.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Itu iso dyoobe dyaku humba kuta bubi, utukune dye iso, na kudi kasa! Kumona mbilweela kwobe kushwela mubutangala bwa Kabejya na iso didimo, kusidi kuyakana na meeso mabidi na ukasibwe jehanamu, <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />buwa didi bivinyu byaye ndabiki mota, wala mudilo waaye ndaukizimika.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Kila mundu ukila mumudilo wa kusuba na haŋa ni iyakaneye mungwa winikindu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kindi kyetula baana Baisilaeli buabile bwabidyazi bene mukuyivundanya na mungwa ti ndabi nyanganga, lola Walawi 2.13</char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />«Mungwa ukiyakananga kindu kilweela. Ila itu wa zizimisha kisa kyaaye, uutabini kwa kualusha kisa kyaaye? Na banyu muyakane na mungwa munda mwiinu, na muyakane nyaa, kila mundu na mwizinaye».<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu walula bandu manee goyisamizyena kwa wamwazi na wamunumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Ihani Yeesu haya huma mu dyee buga, haya wena u issi kya Bayudeya mugela wa bubidi wa luyi lwa Yolodani. Na bigandu bya bandu habya mukumba gungi kakaa na uganda mabusu gayi hekilu ba luula byeebya byebwa nangi muuta masu goso.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Ihani Bafalisayo bamu haba sheena hangondu waayi haba muyujya koo mutega: «Buta bwiitu bulu sagula mundu usama mwajyayi?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yeesu haya ba lunga: «Musa gubu misigila bilagu bini?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Haba boya: «Musa gubu tu sawiila tii, wa munumi wa sinyi ishoshwa kyoo mu sama mwajyaayi na ujyanga».<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yeesu haya ba lunga: «Musa gubu mi sinyina banyu biibi manee ga matima yiinu goo mini. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Haboobwa ishu twa gahalu'a u sombelu hanha Kabejya heebu bumba bwinandu, Kabejya gubu bumba wa munumi na wa mwazi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mwanzo 1:27</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Ukidila biibi wa munumi wa samanga shaayi na najyaayi, na wa namatanga udi mwajyaayi. <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Na ebu babidi ba yananga bubidi gu gumu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Mwanzo 2:24 </char></note> Na ebu ndabo yaana babidi lungi, haboobwa ndabadi mubidi gugumu. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />U biibi, mundu nangi yumu ndi hambululanga baba Kabejya bebu namanya hamonga».<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Mitongi ya Yeesu hababu shweela mu kyee yendi lungi, haba mu yuujya Yeesu gaaga mahuya. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Na Yeesu haya ba sawila: «Ishu mundu wajyanga mwajyayi na utundula yungi woota masenga manee wasama mwajyaayi wa mabusu. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Na ishu wa mwaazi wa bagala udi munumi waayi na utundu'a na munumi yungi na eyu woota masenga manee wasama munumi waayi wa mabusu».<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa fiyugula baana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Lusu lumu, bandu haba visha baana ba balengi udi Yeesu tii, waba fiyugudi. Habobwa dingisi yayi haya banyajya baaba bandu. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Yeesu bwebu mona biibi, haya wata iizi na haya boya: «Musami baana ba vueye kwanidi mimi. Musami uba zimbila manee Butangala bwa Kabejya* bwa bandu balu fwandana nabu. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Nidi muu mi sawiila unindu: Yoowa gooso sha tambulanga Mahuya ga Butangala bwa Kabejya* bidi mwana wa mulenge, kokoko ndo shweela monga.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Ihani Yeesu haya yambidila baaba baana na uba hibiila mabo'o gaayi, yumu na yumu, na haya ba fiyugula.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ukaana bibi mwaana mu shoo lola Matayo 18.3; na lola lungi Malako 9.37 manee goo ba tambula baana ba shoo.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu na mundu gudi na mona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Mukye'a ihindi ibwa nangi Yeesu ayinanga mu zila, mundu yumu haya vueya mulubilu, haya hona na uvunga manyu mabusu gaayi na haya muyujya: «Mulangidijyi mulegela naati bini kwa uboya tii, na yaani na buumi bwa milumbu na milumbu»?<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yeesu haya mulunga: «Ngyayi kyawa ni taŋanina mundu mulegela? Nda udi mundu mulegela, ha Kabejya ye, halaa. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Guluyu'a byebya Buta byabulu boya uta: ‹Nangu yaana mundu wa uhega bandu. Nanguta masenga. Nangu yiba. Nangu mu sawila mundu majyindi. Nangu teela mundu nangi yuma bubi. Yaana mundu gulu tiina shaayi na najyaayi.›»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kutoka 20:12-16, Kumb 5:16-20</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Yoowa mundu haya mu lunga: «Mulangidijyi, byebya byooso bilu boya mahuya golulu, nilu gata usomba bugenda bwaami.»<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yeesu haya mulola na meesu goo muvula na haya mu sawila: «Kwa kuhina indu kiimuye, kyoo shidi nakyu: Inanga, tanga bindu byobe byooso mugulu uba ga bwiidi tuuku yeye mona. Ishu woota biibi wa yananga na mona u lububi. Ihani uni kumbi».<verse eid="MRK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Haboobwa yuugu mundu hebu telegejya gaaga mahuya, haya vunga lwebu na haya wene na iizi kya butu, manee gubwa nangi na mona ya butu. <verse eid="MRK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yeesu haya lola mitakibwa yayi babu mu nyungalala, na haya ba sawiila: «Mbinyumini mundu didi na mona ushwela mu Butangala bwa Kabejya!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Mitakibwa yayi haya hanunu'a unindu na gaaga mahuya. Ihani Yeesu haya ba sawiila lungi: «Baana baami, koo shweela mu Butangala bwa Kabejya* nguumini! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Byumini lungi ngamiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbi helahela ngamiya kushwela muhundu dya mutubulo, busagudi buumini (musunga), ngubu tii, nda udi mundu wa samuna</char></note> ushweela mu hundu dya mutubula, haboobwa nguumini unindu mundu yidi na mona ushwela mu Butangala bwa Kabejya.»<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Badingisi haba keka unindu habasiki kwiyujyujyena: «Itu mbiibi, inani wa shwelanga mu Butangala bwa Kabejya?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yeesu bya balola na kubasaudila: «Kwa mundu kalunga kumo diidi ndadiki samunika, ila kwa Kabejya ndabeebyo, kumona kwa Kabejya bindu byooso bikisamunika».<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Haŋo Petelo bya musaudila ti: «Lola bangu! Baashu tuvasama byooso kwaku kujyanga beebe!» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yeesu bya yaka: «Ngimusaudila bya kwinikindu, mundu wooso yi sama kyende kyaye, na bakwaye, na misaadi yaye, nazyaye, na shaye, baana baaye, ao makunda maaye kukidila zina dyaami na kukidila mauya maami malweela, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />yowa uebwa mala mia muhuune musenge wa leelo: uebwa byende, ba kwaaye, misaadi, banaazye, baana na makunda, nembebya usubanga, na kindi kivanga kyamisha yooso uebwa bya kebee mwezyo wamisha yooso. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Haŋo babule badi bakumbala biyakana bamongo, na bandu babule badi leelo bamongo biyakana babusu».<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wayakula lwa kasatu kukidila kumota na kufukuka kwaaye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Mukindi kyene Yesu na badingisi baye beene mulwendo lwa kuyena ku Yelusalemu, Yeesu we yena kumbala ya badingisi baye. Na baa badingisi baaye be hanunuka. Na baa bandu beemujyanganga be yudibwa na moyo. Yeesu bya buula mitonge baye kumi na babidi hongondo, na bya bajyongodela lungi kukidila mama mimu kidila. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Bya basaudila: «Muteejye bangu! Twabanda ku Yelusalemu. Kokwa, mimi Mwana wa Mundu nitudibwa mubiboko bya bamupelo na byaba langidijyi ba buta. Ibo binguhaana mubiboko bya bandu basidi Bayaudi kwa kuboya ti namote, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Naibo binguseanga, na bingufidila mata, na bingunywika mijeledi na kunguyaa. Na kisha masu ma satu nifukuka».<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kindu kyeajya Yakobo na Yohane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20.20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Haŋo Yakobo na Yohane, baana ba Zebedayo: ha baava kudi Yeesu na kumusaudila ti: «Mulangidishi, tukihazya ututele kindu kyooso kya tukuazya.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Naiye Yeesu byaa bayuuzya: «Mukivula namuteele kaayi?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Haba musaudila ti: «Haŋa iyakana beebe mubutangala bwobe bwa mbunda, utwabile mbambi yakuyakana hangondo yoobe, yumo kukiboko kyobe kyamwozyo mulume, na yungi kukiboko kyobe kyamwazyo mukazi.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Ni Yeesu bya basaudila: «Ndamukiyuka kekya kyamukihajya. Musamunana kukubila mubungu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mubungu ni lubaya lwaku nywina meema </char></note> wakusuba wambikubila miimi? Ao musamuna kuyabikibwa mu meema kwa kusuba kwambiyabikibwa miimi?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Haba muyaka ti: «Tusamuna.» Haŋo Yeesu bya basaudila: «Kwa kwinikindu, mukubila mubungu wa kusuba wambikubila miimi, na muyabikibwa mu meema kwa kusuba bebya byambiyabikibwa miimi. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Nembebya kubaa biyakana kukiboko kyaami kya mwazyo mulume ao kukiboko kya mwazyo mukazi, ndabikingulola miimi. Maamo mabua ngwabaaba bee bikidibwa tonaa na Kabejya.»<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Haŋa baa badingisi bangi kumi habe teejya mama mauya, haba somba kukwata kiizi mwazyo wa Yakobo na Yohane. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Haŋo Yeesu bya bataana ibo booso nakubazyongodela: «Mukiyuka ti baba baki monebwa bushwa bakulu bamuune mumusenge baba talukila kwa kibandibandi, na baa badi mu tuuna bamonesha bukolo bwaabo. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Nee mbebya ndayi yakana beebya kwa mudi banyu, sindanyi, itu yumo hamukidi hinu ukivula kuyakana mukulu, uki bambana kuyakana muvubi wiinu. <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Na itu yumo hamukidi hiinu ukivula kuyakana wa kumbala ukibambana kuyakana muvubi wa booso. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Kumona mimi Mwaana wa Mundu sivava kwaku boya ti bandu bangu vubile, ila vava kwa kuboya ti navubile na kuhaana mwejyo waami wayakane tudilo dyabandu babule».<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa fuula mukufu Balitimayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Haŋo, Yeesu na badingisi baye haba kazya ku Yeliko, Yeesu he nyomokangeye wowa mukola ukata na badingisi baye na kiandu kikata kya bandu, mundu yumo mukufu wetaanibwa Balitimayo mwaana wa Timayo, wene buyakane hasi hangondo ha zila ukihajya bamu nyanguzye. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Haŋa heva teejyeye ti ni Yeesu wa Nazaleti wene mukukila, bya somba kuyaba kwa muuya wahaulu mukuyakula ti: «Yeesu mwana wa Daudi ungumonene lusa!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Bandu babule haba muhanunukila kwa kuboya ti wayakane nyaa, haŋo iye bya bazya muuya kukila busu na kuyakula ti: «Mwaana wa Daudi, ungufile lusa»!<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Kukidila bebya Yeesu bya tukama na kuyakula: «Mumutaane.» Haŋo haba taana yowa mukufu na kumusaudila ti: «Ukwate tima! Taluka, ukikutaana.» <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Haŋa hetezyeeye beebyo bya vundumuka byakasa ngubu yaaye, bya taluka na kuyena kudi Yeesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yeesu bya muyuzya: «Ukivula na kutele kaayi?» Yowa mukufu bya muyaka ti: «Mulangidijyi, ngivula kumona lungi.» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Haŋo Yeesu bya mujyongodela: «Yenanga butabuke bwoobe bwakufuula.» Hakeaŋa, yowa mukufu byamona lungi, bya zyanga Yeesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu washwela mu Yelusalemu kwa mbundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoh 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Haŋa Yeesu na mitonge habe tuluka tonono na mukola wa Yelusalemu, busu bwa mukola wa Bethfage na Bethania tonono na kituulu kya Mizeituni. Yesu bya yiisha badingisi baye babidi. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Na kubasaudila: «Mwena mumukola udi kumbala yiinu. Haŋa hamushwela muwoo mukola, mubanga mwana wa punda muzitikibwe, haulu haye ndee bandibwa na mundu nee yumo. Mumu zitule na mungu vishileye. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Itu mundu yumo wamuyuujya ti: ‹Kwakaayi mwata beebya?› Mumu saudile: ‹Vidi-nyambi udi naye sungu, umualusha hakeaŋa bila kuloa.›»<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Baba badingisi haba yena na kuka banga mwana wapunda muzitikibwe hangondo ha zila, tonono na kibelo kya kyende, habe somba kumuzitula, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />bandu bamo bavanange haŋa haba bayuzya ti: «Yoo! Mukita kayi? Kwakayi mwazitula yowa mwana wapunda?» <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Baa badingisi haba bayaka beebya bye basaudila Yeesu, na baa bandu haba batabukila kuyeena. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Haŋo haba muvishila Yeesu yowa mwaana wapunda, na kubaza ngubu yaabo haulu yaye, na Yeesu bya yakana haulu yaye. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Bandu babule haba baza ngubu yaabo haulu ha zila; na bangi haba baza matabi mamiti mabava temba muma kunda. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Bandu babule beyenanga busu bwa Yeesu, na baba beeva kumujyanga kunyuma yaye haba bajya miuya yaabo na kuboya ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">«Hosana!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hozana mu kiebalania ni kuboya utufuule hano" lola. Zabuli 86.2 Yelemia 31.7 </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:9">Wafiyudibwe iye uvanga muzina dya Vidi-nyambi!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Zab 118.25-26</char></note><verse eid="MRK 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Na Kabejya wafiyudile butangala bwa shitu mukulu Daudi buvanga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:10">Kabejya watumbibwe yidi haulu!»<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yeesu bya shwela mu Yelusalema. Na kuyena kulubunga lwa Kabejya,* na kulola bee byooso byenange haŋa. Kumona yene ndayite kyoolwa, bya nyomoka, na kuyena kumukola wa Betania kukumo na baaba mitonge baye kumi nababidi.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa loa muti umo washenange na bimuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Mwesa waye, habenange muku nyomoka Betania, Yeesu bya teezya zala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Bya mona mu munonga muti ukitaanibwa mutini udi na mabizi, bya yena kukalola itu kuyakana bimuka kudi wowa muti. Ila he tulukeye tonono na wowa mutu, bya ubanga na bishoshwa bobo, kumona nda kyene kindi kya iwo kuta bimuka. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Haŋo haya jyongodela wowa mutini: «Kusomba leelo mundu nee yumo ndabanga bimuka bya kudya kyoobe!» Na badingisi baye be teejya mama mauya me yakuleye.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wazyanga bandu beudishanga bindu mu lubunga lwa Kabejya*</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoh 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Nyuma ya haŋa Yeesu na badingisi baye haba fika ku kisi kya Yelusalemu, Yeesu haya shwela munda mwa lubunga lwa Kabejya, bya somba kujyanga baba bandu bavanange mukuula na kuudisha bindu munda mwa lubunga. Haya fululujya biibikilo bya bandu bya bavanange muku fululujya mona yaabo, na bikala bya baba bavanange mukuta ma ngudimba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngudimba ni mukwaye ao kilongo kikimo na Kininga, Kutikuti na Katiti</char></note> muulu. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Na ndavasama mundu nee yumo kushwala kindu munda mwa lubunga lwa Kabejya. <figure style="fig" alt="Jésus chasse les marchands dans le Temple" file="WA03896b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade" ref="11.16">Yeesu wajyanga bandu munda mwa Lubunga. </figure><verse eid="MRK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Ibobwa hekilu lula bandu na uboya: «Mahuya ga Kabejya galuboyanga ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 11:17">‹Yendi kyaami bakitaŋananga yendi kya bandu booso umuhajya Kabejya.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Isaya 56.7 lola baanyu mwakifululujya lumba dya bakiyiba </char></note> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Yer 7.11</char></note> Habobwa baanyu mwakifululujya ekyu, kyayani buga dya fyaminu dya baluyiba»!<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Ba ngana batagadi* na balangidijyi ba mahuya buta habatelegejya byebya Yeesu bwebuta na habakilukeba zila yomuhegesha. Haboobwa babwanangi mumutiina, manee igandu kyoso ibuhanunu'a na ndangizyu yaayi. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Haŋa hababufi'a mugela wa yogolwa, Yeesu hamonga na mitakibwa yaayi habahuma mu goowa moola.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Langidijyo kukidila muti wee kasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21.20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Hakeelu pupu, Yeesu na mitongi yaayi haŋa haba bwanaangi akilaanga mu zila, haba mona goowa muti wa mutini wakasa na mizi na mizi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Ihani Petelo haya geza byeebya Yeesu byeebuloba goowa mti, na haya musawiila Yeesu: «Mulangidijyi lola guugu muti wa mutini goobuloga wakasa!»<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Habobwa Yeesu haya basawiila mitakiibwa yaayi: «Muyaani na ulungidila udi Kabejya!  <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Namisawiila unindu, mundu gulubengeneena usagula yoowa gooso mundu wasawiila ki'i ibanjwa: ‹Ziiku'a hadihanhu na inanga na waitaashi munda mwa iziba.› Watabu'a, byooso byeedi muhazya byateebwanga munda mwa tima dyoobe, ihani, byayananga bebya byobuhajya. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Ukidila bibi namisawiila ti: bindu, byooso byamwahajyanga udi Kabejya, mutabu'i ti, Kabejya wamigabila na hanha Kabejya wanibilanga unindu. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Na ishu mudi muuhaajya Kabejya, ishu mundu yumu gubumiteela bubi, mumufwidi lusa. Koboya ti, shiinu ghudi u lububi wamifwiidi na banyu lusa mu bubi bwiinu byanga byeeba. [<verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Na ishu ndamooyana mumumona bandu bangi lusa, shiinu gudi u lububi ndyoo mifwila lusa mu bubi bwamudi mumuteela.»]<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Butangala bwa Yeesu bubu huma uni</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Yeesu na ndingisi* yaayi haba galu'a lungi u issi kya Yeluzalema. Mukyee'a ihindu Yeesu kyebwa nangi musumu'a munda mwa lubunga, ba mupelu batagadi, na balangidijyi ba Buta na banunu babu weena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Balangidijyi ba Buta na banunu uyu'a butangala bwa Yeesu bubu huma uni? Ngu kidila biibi bibuta Yeesu itu twa lola Malako 11.1-26.</char></note> udi Yeesu, haba sheenena udi Yeesu, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />na haba kidi mumu yuujya biibi: «Buubu butangala boobi, bubu vueya uni? Inani fuku gabila butangala boota biibi?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yeesu haya balunga biibi: «Na mimi shaami yujyanga indu kiimu ye. Ishu mwani lunga, na miimi na misawiilanga ubu vueya butangala bwaami. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Muni sawiidi, butangala bwa Yohane boo bayabi'a bandu mu meema, bubu huma udi Kabejya ao u bandu? Muni lungi»!<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Baaba banunu habakidi muuyi yujyijyeena ebu banindu, na haba boya: «Ishu twa mulunga tii: ‹Boobwa butangala bubu huma udi Kabejya›, watu sawiilanga ti: ‹Haboobwa ngyaayi kya mushibu tabwiila Yowani?› <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ishu gungi twabo'a ti: ‹Butangala buvanyomoka ku bandu›, haba tiina bungi bwa bandu manee bandu booso babu tabu'a ti Yohane unindu gubwa nangi mubushi wa Kabejya.» <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Haboobwa haba mu lunga Yeesu ti: «Baashu ndatulu yu'a.» Yeesu haya ba sawiila: «Ishu mbyeebya, na miimi, shomi sawiila nguni ubu vueya butangala mwandi muuta nabu mwambu».<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Muele wa kunda dya mizabibu na mundu kikuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Haŋo Yeesu bya somba kubalangidila kukidila miele; na kuba saudila: «Mundu yumo we kuna kunda dyaye dya mizabibu.* Bya dilukila mubwiila, bya fula kineene kyaku kamina meema mabimuka byami zabibu, na byaluka kyende kibande haulu kya baba bakulolanga dedya kunda. Na bya biika bandu bi habilangeye bimo bimuka bya dyee kunda, bya sumuka ku kisi kingi.<verse eid="MRK 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Haŋa he bambana mafuku maku konona bimuka bya mizabibu, yowa mwini kunda bya yiisha yumo muvubi waye kubaa baki vuba kunda waka mubuudile luba lwaye lwa bimuka bya mizabibu. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ni baba badindikijyi bakunda haba kwata yowa muvubi, haba mutuuta na kumualusha minyu busadi.<verse eid="MRK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Mwini wakunda bya yiisha lungi muvubi yungi, yowa naye byaba mubongola ku mushu na kumukaya.<verse eid="MRK 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Haŋo bya yiisha bangi bavubi baye babule, hamukidi haabo byaba batuta, na bangi haba bayaa.<verse eid="MRK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Mwini kunda we shaala na mundu yuumo wa kuyiisha, mwana waye we vulangiye. Bya mu yiisha byakebee kumongo. Mukuejya: ‹Bimu teejya mwana wami›. <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Ila baba bakivuba kunda dya mizabibu haba kwijyobojya kukumo: ‹Yuu ni muyaani wa shaye; muve tumuyae mukuboya ti kuyaana kwa yakana kwiitu!› <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Haŋo haba kwata yowa mwana, haba muyaa, na kukasa kyee kitumba haaza hadye kunda dyamizabibu.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Haŋo, Yeesu bya yujya: Haŋo mwini kunda dya mizabibu uuta bini? Huuva na kuyaa baba bakivuba dye kunda, na dedya kunda dya mizabibu hubaabila bandu bangi.<verse eid="MRK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Nguboya ti ndamwesinyulula bubu businye bwa Kabejya buki boya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">‹Ibwe dyee bengebwa na baa bakiluka byende</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">leelo ndadite ibwe dikata dyakaongobela.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Ngukidila Vidi-nyambi, niweeta dii kumo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">Naidyo ni huya dya kuanunusha kumeeso miitu›».<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Zabuli 118.22-23</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Bakulu ba Bamupelo, balangidishi ba buta na banunu be yuka ti wowa muele ukiba tela ibo, haba siki keba zila yakumukwata Yeesu, byaba tiina kiandu kya bandu, haba musama haba yena byabo.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhaana mulambu kudi kaizali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Nyuma yabebya, baba bakulu ba Bayaudi haba yiisha kudi Yeesu bamo Bafalisayo* na bamo bandu ba mwajyo wa Helode kwa kumutea Yeesu mumaa maki yakuleeye.<verse eid="MRK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Habe fika haba muvila na kumujyongodela ti: «Mulangidishi, tukiyuka ti beebe udi mundu yidi buludi; ndudi na moyo na bebya bikiejya bandu bangi na nduki bembeleka na fanda ya haaza ya bandu, ila ukilangidila bya kwinikindu kukidila zila ya Kabejya kukidila buludi, utu saudile! Mbi lweela tu mwabile Kaizali mulambu ao ndamumwabilanga»?<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Haŋo Yeesu bya yuku ndimi yibidi yabo, byaba saudila ti: «Kwakayi mwangu teela muteo? Munguvishile dikuta didimo namone.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Haba muvishila yeya dinali, naiye bya bayujya, «Lulu lukebo lukifandakana nanaani na buubu businye mbwa naani?» Haba muyaka ti: «Ŋjya kolo Kaizali».<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Haŋo, Yeesu bya basaudila: «Muabile Kaizali bindu byaye na Kabejya mumwabile bindu byaye.» Naibo haba musheka kwinikindu.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gyuujyo kukidila kufukuka kwa bandu kumongo ya musenge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Kukila haŋo, Basadukayo bamo haba muviila Yeesu. Hibo Basadukayo ni baki boyanga ti ndakudi kufukuka. Naibo haba muyuuzya Yeesu bibi: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Mulangidishi, Musa we tusinyina mu kilau ti: ‹itu mukwaye na mundu wamota na wasia mukazi waye nee kusia mwaana, mwinawaye ukibambana kuyaana yowa mwadyangu kwa ku butudila mukwaye baana.› <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Haŋo, kwene balungwa musambo. Yowa wa busu bya tundula mukazi, bya mota nee kubutula mwaana. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Wakabidi bya yaana yowa mwadyangu, iye naiye bya mota nee kusia mwaana. Byaya yakana kwa yowa wa kasatu byakeebe. <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Na ku baba booso balungwa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Buŋana ni bwakee boo bwabaki taananga bakwaye na mundu</char></note>musamboo. Ibo booso haba mota nee kusia mwaana. Ku mongo ya booso, yowa wamukazi na iye bya mota. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Haboobwa ihindi kyee'a kya ba fululu'anga baaba banumi baayi mu samboo ba bufwa, yuugu wa mwazi inaani, wa yaananga munumi waayi? Manee booso musamboo babu mu tundula».<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yeesu haya balunga: «Banyu mwa luba, manee nda mulu'a Mahuya* na nda mulu'a butangala bwa Kabejya. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Ihindi kyee'a kya baaba ba bufwa haba fuulu'anga, nda boo tundula lungi na nda boo tundujya baana baabu lungi. Bayanaanga bidi malaika badi u lububi. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Haboobwa ukidila baaba bifukukanga, i uboya ti, nda mukyee silula mu kitabu ibu sinya Musa; haŋa Kabejya heebu sagula mu ati adi mu teema mudilu nangu sheema, lugulugu? Kabejya haya boya na haya musawiila Musa tii: ‹Miimi, nidi Kabejya wa Habulamu, Kabejya wa Isaka, na Kabejya wa Yakobo.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kut 3.2-6</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Yeesu haya boya lungi: Kabejya ndi luyaana Kabejya wa bamote, haboobwa guluyaana Kabejya wa bandu boomi. Unindu, mubu yizimba banyu banindu»!<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilagu kyatagadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Mulangidijyi yumu wa buta haya ba telegejya ebu muu sindaŋana na Yeesu, haya mona ti, Yeesu gubu balunga bilegele. Ihani na eyu haya sheena udi Yeesu na haya mu yuujya: «Munda mwa bilagu byooso, ngilahu* ayi idi kyatagadi?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yeesu haya mulunga: «Ilagu kyatakyata i kii'i: ‹Banyu baana ba Isilaeli mutelegejyi! Vidi-nyambi wiishu ni Kabejya gulu yaana Vidi wishu eyu bunga ye. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Yiluhajyibwa mundu wooso uvula Ngana Kabejya vidi goobe, mu tima dyoobe dyooso, na migeejyo yooso, nyinyi yoobe yooso na butangala boobe booso.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Kue 6.4-5</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Na ilagu kya bubidi i kii'i: ‹Yilu kuhaajya umu vula yoowa gudi hangondo woobe byeebya byolu yivula beebe munindu.› Ndoodi bilagu bingi byatagadi 'ukila biibi bilagu bibidi».<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Wal 19.18</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Ihani mulangidijyi wa buta haya mu sawiila Yeesu: «Mulangidijyi, gaaga mahuya gawa sagulanga unindu. Wasa gula bilegela unindu ti, Kabejya gudi eyu bunga ye, na nda udi Kabejya lungi bidi eyu. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Mundu gooso gulu bengeneena 'umu vula Kabejya na tima dyayi dyooso, na nyinyi yaaye yooso, na butangala bwaayi booso, na vula mundu didi hangondo woobe beebya byoolu yivula beebe mu nindu bilukila bwinanyama booso bulu jyijyibwa na utuula salaka, na byee bingi byooso bilu tuula bandu mabusu ga Kabejya bidi salaka.» <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Haŋa Yeesu heebu mona ti, walunga na nyinyi yilegela, Yeesu haya mu sawiila: «Ndudi ula na Butanga bwa Kabejya.» U somba luulu lusu nda udi mundu fumu heleejya kumu yuujya Yeesu huuya dingi.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masiya na Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-44">Mat 22.41-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Haŋa Yeesu heebwa nagi muu lulu bandu mahuya, munda mwa lubunga* haya ba yuujya binu: «Baaba balangidijyi ba Buta* ngyayi kya badi muu boyela ti, Masiya* shaayi ni Daudi? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Manee Daudi eyu mu nindu Tima Dito'ato'a dibu muludi'a uboya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‹Vidi-nyambi gubu boya udi Vidi-nyambi waami:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Vueya, yaani mugela wa ubo'o kwaami kwa mugela munumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Mupaka haŋa hambi bika balwishi boobe haasi hamaulu moobe.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Ps 110.1</char></note><verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Haŋa Daudi eyu mu nindu gubu sagula ti: Ngana waayi. Haboobwa ya yananga bini Masiya* uyaana mwaana lungi mwaana wa Daudi»?</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Yeesu walanga bandu ukidila ba langidijyi ba Buta</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Na bandu ba butu babu mu telejya na 'usehelela. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Haŋa Yeesu heebwa nangi muu ba luula, haya ba sawiila binu: «Muyi lodi na mu yaanangi na bubangu na baaba ba langidijyi ba Buta. Manee ebu balu vula ukila ŋana na balu vula uvuala ngubu yilayila, na balu vula bandu uba hanwiina na ineemu munda mwa bi gandu, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />lungi balu vula uyaana mu byaala bya mabusu mu Sinagogi.* Na mu bi gandu bya usehelela; balu vula uyaana mu byaala bya ineemo. Na uheebwa biyaazi bya ineemo, mu bigandu bya tabyata bya balu tee'a biyaazi. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ebu balu kuujya ba fwiidi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ukujya bindu bya ba fwiidi. Ngu moneshs hululu byeebya baaba babu tebemena Lubunga* bya balu teela badyangu.Ukidila majyindi na bubi bwa badi nabu. Lola Isaya 10.1-2.</char></note> bindu byaabu. Balu haajya, kwa butu! Kooboya ti, bandu babamone. Ukidila biibi, Kabejya waba titiminyanga bubibubi ukila bandu booso».<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sadaka ya mwadyangu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Habu kila biibi, Yeesu haya weena na haya yaana hasi tega mabusu ga idindu kyoo tuudila sadaka udi Kabejya. I heeki muu lola bandu byeebya byaba bwa nangi muu tuula sadaka yaabu munda mwa 'idindu. Baaba badi na mona ya butu, haba tuula mona ya butu munda mwa idindu.<verse eid="MRK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Mwadyangu yumu shidi na mona ya butu, haya vueya na eyu, haya tuula bishedi bi shoŋono bibidi bya fwalanga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bishedi bi shoŋono bibidi bya fwalanga: Mu kiliki fwalanga hanha ni: «Lepton» yibwa nangi fwalanga yi shoo, ukila fwalanga yooso.</char></note> mu kyee idindu, yeeya mona nda yi bwa nangi na ineemo.<verse eid="MRK 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Ihani Yeesu haya taŋana mitongi yayi na haya ba manya: «Nami sawiila unindu: Guugu mwadyangu asuvi, eyu watuula ukila baaba booso bandu babu tuula sadaka mu idindu. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Manee, baaba bangi booso babu tuula yeeya mona yibu shagala, haba gula byeebya byababu vula. Haboobwa yuugu mwadyangu ashuvi, eyu watuula yaayi yooso yeebwa nangi nayu yoo mulula.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa saula kuongolebwa kwa lubunga lwa Kabejya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Haŋa he nyomokanga Yeesu mu lubunga lwa Kabejya, yumo ha mukidi ha dingisi baye bya musaudila ti: «Mulangidishi lola bangu! Bidi mabu malweelamalweela na bii byende bikatabikata!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Haŋo Yeesu bya muyaka na kumu saudila: «Ukimona biibi byende bikata? Ndakwa kushaala ibu nee didimo haulu ha dingi, mooso mi hongolebwa»!<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubushwa kwa kusuba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />He nange Yeesu ku kituulu kya Mizeituni, kuyelekela lubunga lwa Kabejya. Petelo na Yakobo na Yohane na Andelee, haba mubanga, ha beene ibo bunga na Yeesu, haba muyuzya ti: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Utusaudile, maama mauya mi teebwa hakayi? Na ngikaayi kimonesha ti maama mauya ndamate tonono na kuteebwa»?<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Haŋo Yeesu bya somba kubasaudila: «Mukwi kengeyele! Mundu nee yumo ndababembela! <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Kumona bandu babule biiva mu zina dyaami, muku yakula ti: ‹Miimi ni Masiya› naibo bi bembela bandu babule. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Mumaa mafuku hamuteejya bandu baki yakula kukidila kiaya mabua mooso na tumbukumbuku twa kiaya, ndamu tiina; kumona bye byooso biki bambana kusosoka, ila ndaya kuyakana bangu mongo ya musenge. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Kumona kisi kimo kinyomoka kulwa na kisi kingi, na bukolo bumo bu nyomoka kulwa na bukolo bungi; kuyakana mindengenyi ya mateke mabua mabule na kuyakana zala; maamo mooso miyakana bidi kisumwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Haŋo kwamudi banyu, mukwi kengeyele; kumona bandu bimu shwala banyu busu bwa balamuzi; na mu tutibwa muma lubunga maabo; na mu shwadibwa busu bwa bakulu ba kisi na ba kolo kukidila zina dyaami, kwa kuyakana kindu kya fikidijyo dyami kwabadi. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Kumona yiki bambana bangu mauya ma lweela ma Kabejya ma saudibwe kubandu booso. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Haŋa habi mushwalanga busu bwa balamuzi, ndamu kwiyujya muyakula kayi. Ila muyakule bobo mama mamu hebwa kekya kindi, kumona nda banyu biyakula, ni Tima dya Kabejya. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Bandu bi tuula balungwa baabo kwa kuboya ti baba yae na shaye na mundu utuula mwaana waye kwaku boya ti bamu yae, na baana bi jyumbidila ba shabo na kuboya ti baba yae. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Bandu booso bimu hejyela bubi kukidila zina dyami. Ila yowa wooso yikwata tima ngungungu tii kumongo ufuuka kutima».<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusuba kukata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24.15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />«Yeesu bya boya: ‹Hamumona zibisha dya kuvundanya› dya taluka mubua disiki bambaneye kuyakana. Yowa ki sinyulula maa mauya wama yuke bi lweela. Haŋo baba biyakananga ku Yudea bazyukile kubituulu. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Yowa wooso yi yakananga haulu ha kinduulu ndasala kushwela mu kyende kubuula kimo kindu. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Na yowa yi yakana kukunda ndaaluka lungi kwaye kwakuka buula ngubu yaye. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Mu mama masu lusa kubaabakazi badi na ma yimi na kubaaba baki nyamwisha! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Muajye Kabejya bebya bindu ndabiva mu masu mavula! <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Kumona kusuba kwa mu mama mafuku ku yakana kukata. Kwa shemoneka nee lumo kusomba bebya byeta Kabejya kisi hadi leelo. Na kusuba kwa bebya ndakwa kumoneka lungi. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Ishu Vidi-nyambi ndahindigizya gaaga masu, koko, ndaudi mundu wambufu'a. Haboobwa, manee ga baaba babusobolebwa, wahindiyijyanga gaaga masu.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Mu ihiindi kii'i ishu mundu yumu wamisawiila: ‹Lola! Masiya* gudi hanu!› Au ishu wasagula lungi: ‹Lola! Masiya* gudi koo'a!› Nda mumutabu'anga! <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Manee kwahumanga bandu babutu ba majyindi bahumanga na uboya ti: ‹Mimi i masiya.› Kwa vueyanga na banganga biloota bamazyindi. Baaba booso batanga bindu byoo hanunusha bandu, ishu basamunaanga, babazimbi na baba bandu Kabejya bebusobola. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Habobwa banyu muyilodi bilegela! Manee nibumisawiila biibi bindu byooso mabusu ga ebyu uhuma».<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wagalushanga lungi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />«Yeesu waboya lungi, mu ihindi kyee'a, ishu usuba kwabutu kwakila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">‹Yuba, dyafulu'anga muzimbwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:24">Na mwangu, ndagoyanga lungi,<verse eid="MRK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Na tumwinuŋuna na etu, twayananga muuhulu'a u lubibu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 13:25">Na byooso bidi na butanga u lububi bya tengatengaanga.›<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Isaya 13.10, 34.4</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Abobwa bandu banimonanga miimi Mwaana wa Mundu navueyanga munda mwa matimba, nayananga na butangala bwabutu na hamonga na mbunda yatayata. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Niyishanga malaika* baami mugela gooso mu bwinandu, bakongobodi bandu booso baba bambusobola».<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndangijyu yidi munda mwa muti wa mutini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />«Yeesu haya boya lungi: Banyu booso muyu i ndangijyu yidi munda mwa muti wa mutini. Haŋa hamwamona matabi gaayi gakulumu'a na mabizi gaayi gatombela, muluyu'anga ti, buyogo bwanenama. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Na byangabyeeba, ihindi kyamwamonanga bibi byandi mumisawiila bidi mu bwaata muuteebwa, muyu'i tii, miimi Mwaana wa mundu, nidi nena na bibelu. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Namisawiila u nindu: Bandu baguni mulongo nda boofwa booso mabusu gabibi byooso byandi mumisawiila ufi'a. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Lububi na maavu byakilanga, habobwa mahuya gaami ndagookila kokooko.»<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kabejya eyu bunga i guluyu'a ihindi kya mongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24.36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />«Yeesu haya boya lungi, ukidila loolwa na ihindi kyakilanga biibi: Ndaudi mundu ngiyuka. Nangi malaika badi munda mwa lububi, nangi miimi Mwaana, shiluyu'a. Ni Kabejya shiitu ye, halaa, i guluyu'a lusu loolwa.<verse eid="MRK 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Ukidila biibi muyaani na bubangu! Manee ndamulu'a ihiindi kii'i hakyafianga.<verse eid="MRK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Kii'i ihiindi idi mufwandaana na mundu gudi muyisesa mulugendo. Yuugu didi muyisesa wasiga yende kyaayi muminyu ya bavubi baayi, na umumonesha yumu na yumu butangala bwauta mwambu woowa webumugabila. Ihani haya sawiila yoowa luyaana kwiibelu, babuludi meesu hululu. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Muyaani meesu hululu! Manee ndamulu'a ishu mbaayi ao ihindi ayi mwiini yendi kyaya galushanga, ishu mbayowolwa, ishu mu bwaata bwa bufu'u, ishu mbamu'u uyoola, ao hakeelo pupu. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Muyaani meesu hululu! Ishu mwiini yendi wagalusha mwiijyejyi, ndimihetanga banyu mubwaata bwatulu. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Biibi byandi mumisawiila, nidi mumisawiila bandu booso: Mulodi»!<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Mulango wakuyaa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoh 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Yene muku shaala masu ma bidi kwa kuboya ti kiandu kya kuselela kya Pasaka na kekya kya mikati yisidi yi hae mabambane. Bakulu ba Bamupelo na balangidishi ba buta be keba zila yaku kwata Yeesu kwa bubango na kumuyaa. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Haŋo be boya ti: «Nda tuta diidi kumo lufuku lwa kiandu kikata, ngasi bandu bata luvundu.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwamukazi yumo walalabisha Yeesu maani mavumba kumushu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoh 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Mu kekya kindi Yeesu wene ku Bethania, mu kyende kya Simoni weene na kivu, henangiye kumeza mu kudya bidyazi, yumo mwamukazi bya shwela na mulangi wa maani mavumba ya naldo yitobe ya muulu waulu. Bya dibela na ku hukudila Yeesu ma maani kumushu waye. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Haŋa hemona ba bamo bandu benange haŋa haba zinguka, na kukwisauyjena ti: «Kwa kayi kuzizimisha malashi maama? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Kumona maa malasi mandi udishibwa mu dinadi mia yisatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinadi mia yi satu, ni mona yiva heebwanga muvubi musha uumo</char></note> kwaku haana ku tuuku!» Haba muozwela kwabule yowa mwamukazi.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Haŋo Yeesu bya basaudila: «Musame yowa mwamukazi bangu. Kwakayi mwamushuvya? Wangundela kindu kilweela. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Kumona tuuku mudinato kila lusu na kindi kyooso kya muvula kuba nyangujya mubanyangujya; ila miimi ndamwa kuyakana naami masu mooso. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Yuu mwamukazi waata keekya kiva samuneye; wa hukudila lukoba lwami maani ma vumba kukidila kubiika tonaa maziko maami. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Kwa kwinindu ngimusaudila ti ko kwooso kusaudibwa mauya ma Kabejya, mu musenge, diidi huya dyata yuhu mwamukazi di saudibwa kwa kumuhejya.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda watabuka kutuula Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Haŋo Yuda Iskaliota, yumo mu mitonge kumi na yibidi ba Yeesu, bya yena kubakulu ba Bamupelo* ti watuule Yeesu kwa badi. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Bamupelo bakulu* habe teejya wowa musau haba seelela, haba mubadijya kumwabila falanga. Haŋo Yuda bya yakana mukukeba zila yaku tula Yeesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wadya pasaka kukumo na mitonge baye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22.7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoh 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Lusu lwa kwanza lwa mikati yisidi yihae, mu masu mabe shijyanga mwana wa mukoko wa Pasaka mitonge ba Yeesu haba muyuujya ti: «Nguni kwa ukivula tuku lungakanyine bua dya kudiila Pasaka?»*<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Haŋo Yeesu bya yiisha mitonge baye bamo babidi na kuba saudila: «Mweene kumukola; kokwa mu kumaana na mwamulume yumo uva kushwala kaujyi ka meema muye kumulonda. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Mukasaudile mwini wa kekya kyende kishweleye: ‹Mulangidishi uki boya, kidi kuni kyumba kya baini kyambidila Pasaka* kukumo na mitonge yaami.› <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Naiye mwini kindu uba monesha kyumba kikata kya haulu ha kyende, kiva bikibwa tonaa; moomwa muka lungakanyine mwakale.»<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Baba mitonge haba yena kumukola, na kuka banga bindu byoso byake be biva basaudila Yeesu, na haba lungakanya bidyazi bya Pasaka. <verse eid="MRK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Haye bambana kyoolwa, Yeesu byava na baa mitonge baye kumi na babidi. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Ha benange mukudya, Yeesu bya basaudila: «Ngimusaudila bya kwinikindu, yumo hamukidi hiinu, ukidya kukumo nami ungu tuula.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Haŋo mitonge baye haba somba kuozwa, haba muyuujya yumo kwa yumo ti: «Itu jyaami?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yeesu byaba yaka: «Njyumo hamukidi hiinu banyu kumi na babidi, njyowa yi tabika kiboko kukumo nami mu bakudi. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Kumona Mwaana wa Mundu wayena byaye bebya byaye sinyibwa kukidila iye mubusinye bwa Kabejya. Ila kusuba kwa yowa yituula Mwaana wa Mundu! Yandi yakana bilweela yowa mundu ndandi butuka»!<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meza ya Vidi-nyambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22.14-20</ref>; 1Wak 11.23-25)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Haŋa habe dyanga bidyazi, Yeesu bya buula mukati bya hajya kwa kuboya ti Kabejya wau fiyudile, bya ubela na kuabila mitonge yaye na kuboya: «Mu buule mudye luulu ni lukoba lwami.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Bya buula byakeebe mubungu wa divai bya boya abee! Kudi Kabejya, bya baabila. Ibo booso habanywa. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yeesu bya basaudila: «Wuuwu ni muloa waami wa kilemba kya Kabejya, na uki hukuka kukidila bandu babule. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Kwa kwinikindu ngimusaudila ti, shakukubila lungi divai dya mizabibu, mupaka lolwa lusu lwa mbikubila yeya yiya mu bukolo bwa Kabejya.»* <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Ha beewa kuyimba lusimo, haba hezela na kuyena ku kituulu kya Mizeituni.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wabusha ti Petelo umutuna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoh 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yeesu bya saudila mitonge yaye ti: «Banyu booso mungusama, kumona businye bwa Kabejya bukiboya ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">‹Nituta mudindikijyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 14:27">Na mikoko yimwangalala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lola Zakalia 13.7</char></note>›.<verse eid="MRK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ila haŋa hambi fukuka, niba tondokela ku Galilaya.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petelo bya muzyongodela ti: «Nee yayakana ti bangi booso bikusama, miimi shakukusama.» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Haŋo Yeesu bya mujyongodela: «Ngikujyongodela bya kwinikindu ti: leelo buune bufuku busu bwa muko kuyakula mala kabidi, ungutuna mala kasatu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Haŋo Petelo bya fikidijya zizii: «Nee yaajya kumota noobe, nee mbebya shakukusama nee lumo.» Na baba badingisi booso haba yakula byakebee.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu waajya u Gesthsemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Habobwa Yeesu na ndingisi yaayi habafi'a ubuga dimu dibutaŋanibwa Getisemani. Haya ba sawiila: «Muyaani haŋa haasi tega naweena kuhaajya.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Yeesu haya bugula Petelo, na Yakobo na Yohane haya weena hamonga nabu. Hayasuba munda mwa tima na haya mona mooyo. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Habobwa haya ba sawiila: «Tima dyaami dya suba na unoŋe'a, dyafi'a nena na umota. Muyaani haŋa? Ndamu tandabala mutulo».<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Haŋa? Heebu basiga na haya weena mabusu hashoo, haya vunga manyu gayi haasi haya haajya Kabejya binu: Ishu mbilegela mabusu ga meesu goobe, mukinu ihindi, usuba kuu'u kwanikidi uula. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Heekilu boya lungi: «Abba, Taata, beebe gulusa muna 'uta bindu byooso. Uni bagashidi lubaya luulu loosuba. Haboobwa nanguta byeebwa byandi muuvula miimi, haboobwa tanga byeebya beebe byoolu vula.»<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Ihani haya galusha udi ndingisi* yaayi yisatu, na haya baheta mu bwaata bwa tulu. Ihani haya mu sawiila Petelo: «Simoni, wa laala? Ndubu samuna u yaana nangulala nangi ihindi kiimu yega? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Mulodi na muhaajyi, mwafi'a kuu shelumu'a mu bubi. Tima didi na butangala haboobwa mubidi ngu lebedi».<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Yeesu haya weena lungi ku haajya, haya haajya lungi byeebya byeebu haajya mabusu. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Ihani haya galu'a lungi udi ndingisi* yaayi na haya ba heta gungi mutulu, manee tulu tubu ba neemena u meesu. Ebu ndaba bumona huuya dyoo mulunga.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Yeesu hebu galu'a lwa busatu udi ndingisi* yaayi kwa badi, haya basawiila ti: «Mwayoya na mwatandabala gungi mutulo? Byoohwa! Ihindi kya miimi usuba kya fi'a. Miimi Mwaana wa Mundu boohwa uni tuula mu minyu ya bandu badi na bubi. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Mutalu'i, twee nangi! Mulodi! Yoowa gooni tuula wanenema kwa ndidi»!<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bamu waata Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yoh 18.3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Hanga haŋa, kubyee Yeesu ndi kyeehwa usagula, yumu munda mwa ndingisi* yaayi wabalu teena Yuda, waheta. Gubu vueya na igandu kya bandu babwa nangi na biyoma na tuti. Babu humina udi baaba balu tebemena lubunga. Balangijyi ba Sambu* na banunu ba Bayuda*. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yuda, gubwa nangi waba gabila soso haya ba sawiila: «Yoowa wanda mu yambidilanga, i eyu. Mumu waati, na mwenangi nayu mumu lodi bilegela.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Haŋa Yuda hebufi'a neena na Yeesu, haya sheena na haya mu sawiila: «Mulangidijyi!» Haya mu yaambidila. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Na baaba bandu haba muhulwiila Yeesu na haba muziti'a. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Ihani yumu dingisi* wa Yeesu haya fufula lweete mu hala, na utemba osho dya muvubi wa ngana ya Lubunga*.<verse eid="MRK 14:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yeesu haya mu sawiila: «Miimi nidi mundu guluyiba, kwa uboya ti, muni vuidi na uniwaata na biyoma na tuti? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Masu gooso, nibwa nangi hamonga miimi muumi luula munda mwa lubunga* haboobwa nda mubu niwaata. Habobwa byafi'a biibi, koo, ubaya ti, byeebya bibu sinyibwa mu Mahuuya ga Kabejya kwa ndi miimi bya kumaŋani».<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Hangahaŋa ndingisi* yaayi yooso haba mu sama na haba jyonda.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Genda yumu gubu sasila ihindi kya ngubu, hekyee nanga amu kumbanga Yeesu. Ebu muvula ti, bamu waati, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Ihani haya ba sigila kaa'a ahindi ka ngubu haya jyonda ngela.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu mabusu ga ba nunu ba Bayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26.57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22.54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoh 18.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Baaba bandu haba weena na Yeesu udi ngana ya lubunga,* ba nunu ba Bayuda na ba langidijyi ba Buta* haba ganda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bi kwayaba biatagadi byooso, na ba nunu haba ganda: Igandu kii'i ibwa nangi lubaza lwatagadi lwa ba Yuda (Lola musiizi wa 55; Matayo 26.570).</char></note> booso mudyee buga. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Ihani eyu Petelo, gubu wenanga amu kumbanga Yeesu eyu ula haba shweela mu igala kya yende kya Ngana mwatagadi. Haya yaana na badindijyi ebu muu yota mudilu <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Baaba Byaalaŋanda na banunu booso ba Bayuda haba kilukeba huuya dyoo mu titiminya Yeesu, koo boya ti, bamuhege. Haboobwa ndababu mona huuya nangi dimu.<verse eid="MRK 14:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Bandu ba butu haba mu sawiila Yeesu majyindi koo mu titiminya. Haboobwa byeebya byaba bwanangi muusagula bibu handaŋana nda bibu waata. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Ihani bamu mu bwaata bwaabu habatalu'a na usagula bya majyindi udi Yeesu na usagula biibi: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Tubu yitelegejyela bahu baashu banindu eyu mu sagula ti: ‹Na hongolanga luulu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nalu hongolanga lubunga luulu: Malako 15.29; na 'ugalu'a 'udi Yohane 2.19-22.</char></note> lubunga* lubu vubibwa na bandu, na munda mwa masu ga satu, na vubanga lungi lushibu vubibwa na minyu ya bandu.›» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Haboobwa gaaga mahuya gaabu gabu handaŋana.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Ihani mupelo mwaata wa lubunga hayatebema mabusu ga bandu booso, na haya mu yuujya Yeesu: «Ndudi muu lunga huuya nangi dimu u gaaga ma huuya gooso bandu byabadi muuku titiminya nagu?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ihani Yeesu haya gunda nyaa, na ndibu luunga huuya nangi dimu. Yoowa Ngana ya lubunga haya mu yuujya lungi: «Beebe i Masiya,* Mwaana wa Kabejya mu to'ato'a?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yeesu haya mu luunga: «I miimi!. Na mwani monanga miimi Mwaana wa Mundu naya nanga mugela munumi wa Kabejya didi na butangala booso. Na mwami monanga mu bwaata bwa matimba avueyanga uhumina u lububi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Yoowa mupelo wa lubunga heebu telegejya biibi, haya handa ngubu yaayi manee ga iizi na haya boya: «Nda too keba bandu lungi boo sagula mahuya gaayi! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Mwayi telegejyala banyu ba nindu byeebya byeedi muu kaya Kabejya. Mulu boya bini?» Ebu booso hamonga haba lunga tii, gulu bengeneena umota. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Bangi babwa nangi mu bwaata bwaabu haba mufidila Yeesu mata. Haba mu bwiila ngubu u meesu na haba muta bi vungila na umu sawiila: «Tanga asa'u! Utu sawiidi baashu mundu gudi muu ku sosa!» Na baaba baalonga buvuadi haba mu waata Yeesu na umuta makofi.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petelo wa mutuna Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoh 18.15-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Mukyee'a ihindi, Petelo gubu yaana haasi mu kiambala kya Ngana ya lubunga, musi'a yumu muvubi wa Ngana ya lubunga ayafi'a koo'a ubwa nangi Petelo. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Haya mu mona Petelo eyu muu yota mudilu, haya mulola bilegela na haya mu sawiila tii: «Beebi neeyu, gubwa nangi hamonga na Yeesu mundu wa Nazaleti.» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Ihani Petelo haya tuna na haya boya: «Shilu yu'a na shidi muu telegejye byoodi muu sagula. Shidi muu yu'a biibi byoodi muusagula.» Ihani haya weena haajya wa kyambala kwii belu. Hanga haŋa muko hawa yoola.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Yuugu musi'a. Hebu mu mona lungi, haya boya na haya sawiila bandu babwa nangi hanha: «Yuugu mundu ngyumu mu bwaata bwaabu!» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Ihani Petelo haya tuna gungi, baaba bandu babwa nangi hanha na ebu haba mu sawiila Petelo: «Unindu, gudi yumu waabu! Manee gudi mundu wa Galilaya.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Haboobwa Petelo hee kidi mu bwaata muuta muhoho na 'uboya: «Miimi shiluyu'a mundu yuugu wamudi muu nisawiila. Ishu nasagula majyindi Kabejya wani titiminyi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Ihindi nangulolwa, mu'u hawa yoola lwa bubidi. Ihani Petelo haya geejya mahuuya gabu mu sawiila Yeesu: «Mabusu ga mu'u uyoola lwa bubidi, wayananga wani tuna myunda yisatu.» Petelo haya dila.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Yeesu busu bwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yoh 18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Haye bambana mukisi pee, bakulu ba bamupelo ha badya mulangu kukumo na banunu, na balangidishi ba buta, bya bata kaole kumuzitika Yeesu na kumu buula byaba mushwala busu bwa Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato bya yuujya Yeesu ti: «Ngwinikindu beebe ni Kolo wa Bayaudi?» Yeesu bya yaka: «Beebe ni wayakula».<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Bakulu ba Bamupelo haba fikila bindu byabule kudi Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Haŋo Pilato bya yuujya Yeesu lungi ti: «Iba buubu, nduki yaka kindu mumaa mauya mabavisha na kufikila kwaudi beebe?»  <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Haŋo Yeesu ndemuyaka kindu ni Pilato bya sheeka.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato watula Yeesu wa mote</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yoh 18.39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Yene bwaama kila kiandu kikata kya Pasaka, Pilato wahangudile bandu mundu yuumo yidi buzitikibwe wabivula. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Mukekya kindi, kwenange kilwanyi yumo we taanibwa Balaba, wene buzitikibwe kukumo na beezinaye bangi bilwanyi, kumona beyaishisha mundu lufuku lwa beeta luvundu mumukola. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Kiandu kikata kya bandu hakyamuyila Pilato na kusomba kumuajya wabatele bebya byene bwama bwaye. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato bya bayujya ti: «Mukivula namulekedele Kolo wa Bayaudi?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Uva bayujya bebya kumona uva yuka bilweela ti bakulu ba Bamupelo bava tula Yeesu mubiboko byaye kwa mukau.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Haŋo baba bakulu ba Bamupelo haba sosela kiandu kya bandu bamuazye Pilato waba zitudile Balaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato bya yujya lungi kiandu kyabandu: «Haŋa mukivula nate bini na yuu wamukitaana Kolo wa Bayaudi?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Haba bazya miuya nakuboya ti: «Umukomene misumadi haulu ha musalaba».<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato bya bayuzya lungi ti: «Mbuke bubi bwateeye?» Haŋo ibo haba yaba lungi na kubazya miuya na kuboya ti: «Umukomene misumadi haulu ha musalaba»!<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilato kwa kuvula kulwejya kekya kiandu kya bandu; byaaba zitudila Balaba, kisha bya tesha Yeesu tundendele na kumu tuula ti bamu komene misumadi haulu ha musalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basola bamusea Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoh 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Balonga-buvadi haba mushwala Yeesu mukyambala kya mukulu wa kisi, na haba taana kiandu kyoso kya balonga-buvadi. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Haba tubila Yeesu ngubu yimonga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kubayaudi ngubu yimonga yene ngubu ya bukolo</char></note>, haba zinga kihoo kya meeba, haba muibika kumushu. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Haŋo haba somba bangu kumu sambitila na kuboya ti: «Twaku sambitila beebe Kolo wa Bayaudi!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Na haba muta kumushu na malenge, haba mufidila mata; na kumufukikila manyu na kumunyinamina. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Haŋa habeewa kumuseelela, haba muhusula yeya ngubu yimonga shuu, haba mutubila lungi ngubu yaye, kisha haba mu nyomosha haaza kwa kuboya ti bamuyae mu kumukomena misumadi haulu ha musalaba.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyaibwa kwa Yeesu haulu hamusalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoh 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Habenange mukunyomoka mudye bua, haba kumaana na mundu yumo kunyomokela kuma kunda we taanibwa Simoni wene mundu wa mukola wa Kilene. Yuwu wene shabo na Aleksanda na Lufo. Balonga-buvadi haba mukomena ti washwale Musalaba wa Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Haŋo baba balonga-buvadi haba mushwala Yeesu mubua diki taanibwa Golgota, deedyo zina diki boya ti: «Bua dya kabombo.» <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Haŋa, Haba mwabila divai didi busobakanyibwe na manemane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manemane yene buanga bwakutalazya kuzyaba</char></note>, ila Yeesu ndetabuka kumanywa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Haŋo haba musubisha haulu ha musalaba, na kuabaana ngubu yaye muku yitele ndonge kwaku yuka ti kila yowa ubuula kai. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Kyee'a ihindi kya babu mu kokela misumani u musalaba, bibwa nangi bihindi bya saa yisatu ya hakeelu. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Babusinya mu lubagu, bubi Yeesu bwebuta koo boya ti, bamu titiminyi: «Kolo wa Bayuda.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngana dya Bayuda: Lola musiizi wa 2.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Babu suvya balu kuujya bindu bya bandu ba bidi u misalaba, yumu mugela wa munumi na yungi mugela wa mwaazi. [<verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Ni bebya byebambana Businyebukiboya: «Webikibwa bua didimo na baaba bakita bubi.»] <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Bandu babu kidila haŋa mu dyee buga babu mukaya Yeesu na babu tenga mishu yaabu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Haba tenga misha u monesha tii, Yeesu mundu wa busadi na umukaya. Lola Yobu 16.4; Zaburi 22.7; 44.14; 109.25 Isaya 37.22; Yeremia 18.16; 48.27; 12.17-18; 13.7.</char></note> na haba boya: «Hee! Beebi gubu boya ti, wa hongalanga lubunga* na ulu yenga mu masu ga satu!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beebe gulu hongola lubunga na ulu yenga mu masu ga satu. Lola Malako 14.58; Yhane 2.19; Matendo 6.14.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />Uyi fuudi beebe munindu na uyishajyi haasi ga guugu musalaba!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Na ebo beedi baba mupelo hamonga na balangidishi ba Buta* babu mu seha Yeesu na 'uboya ti: «Gubu fuula babutu, haboobwa uyi fuula eyu munindu ndidi muu samuna! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Ishu ngu nindu gudi Masiya, mwanaana wa Isilaeli, wasadi bwangabuni mumu salaba! Ishu twamona biibi, twamu tabu'anga.» Na baaba balukuujya bindu bya bandu babuhudihwa hamonga na Yeesu umisalaba, yumu haya mukaya byangabyeebya.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wamota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45">Mat 27.45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoh 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Kusomba yuuba mubwaata na ufi'a u bihindi bisatu bya yogolwa, muzimbwa hawashweela mu bwinandu booso. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Habobwa mu bihindi bisa bya yuma, Yeesu haya yaba na muhuuya waataghadi: «Eloi, Eloi, lama sabakatani?» I uboya ti: «Kabejya waami, Kabejya waami kyaayi kyawanisamina?» <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Bamu bandu babwanangi haŋa bwabutelegejya biibi, hababoya: «Mutelegejyi! Gudi mumutaŋana Eliya!» <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Mundu yumu mubwaata bwaabu hayaweena mulubilu, haya bugula indu ilufifya meema haya yujya sifongo, haya gaanga u lenge na haya mubazyila heegulu mu buludi bwa kwanywa kwa Yeesu, ti, Yeesu wanyu. Ihani hayaboya: «Mumusami hanga haŋa? Tumoni ishu Eliya wavueyanga kuu musazya heegulu wa musalaba!» <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ihani Yeesu hayaba na muhuuya watagadi na haya mota! <verse eid="MRK 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Mukyanga kyee'a ihindi, ngubu yababuzimba mubwaata bwa lubunga hayatembe'a bihindi bibidi, usomba heegulu na ufi'a haasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Haŋa habulola ngana ya baalonga buvuadi ba Bayuda gubutebama mabusu ga Yeesu haya mumona byeebye byeebufwa, haya boya: «Guuyu mundu gubwanaangi unindu Mwaana wa Kabejya.» <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Babaazi bamu babwanangi hanha haasi tega na ebu mulola byeebya bidimuteebwa ebu ula. Mubwaata bwaabu mubwanangi Madiya wa Mgdala, Madiya naajyayi mwaala na Yakobo na Yoze, na Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Baaba i babwanangi mumukumba Yeesu na umuvubila; na bangi babutu hababanda nayi u Yelusalemu.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uzii'a mubidi wa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoh 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Lusu luulu ni lusu wababulonganga bindu bya sabato, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Mundu yumu wabalutaŋana Yozefu gubuvueya u Alimathaya hayafi'a <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Ihaŋa habutelegezya Pilato ti, Yeesu woofwa, haya haanunu'a. Habobwa haya mutaŋana ngana ya alonga buvuadi, haya muyuujya ishu Yeesu uvamotakwinikindu. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Haŋa hebutelegejya ngana ya balonga buvuadi yamusawiila na kwanywa kwaayi ti, Yeesu wamota, haya mutabwiila Yozefu ubugula mubidi waayi. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Ihani Yozefu haya gula ngubu yito'ato'a na haya weena nayu, haya shajya mubidi wa Yeesu u musalaba, haya guganga mu ngubu, na haya weena haya gumotola munda mwa ivwa dyababusooya munda mwa abu. Ihani haya bugula abu katakata, haya bwiila u kwanywa kwa ivwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />I ebu Madiya wa Magadala na Madiya naajyi na Yoze babumona bugha nyababu bii'a mubidi wa Yeesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kufukuka kwa Yeesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoh 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Haŋa hee kila lusu lwa sabato, Malia wa Magdala na Malia najye na Yakobo, na Salome be ula maani mavumba kwa kuka lalabisha lukoba lwa Yeesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Mukisi pee, lusu lwa yinga, haki somba yuba ku nyomoka haba yena kumufungu. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Muzila ibo kuyenanga haba siki kwiyujyujyena ti: «Ni naani utu kungumunina dedya ibu didi kukibelo kya mufungu?» <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Nembebya haŋa habe tundula meeso mabo, haba mona ti dedya ibu dyene dikata dya kungumunibwa hangondo. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Haŋa baba baabakazi habeshwela mumufungu; haba mona enda yumo, udi buyakane mwazyo mulume we tubila ngubu yitokatoka pee, habee mu mona haba tiina. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Haŋa yowa enda byaba saudila ti: «Ndamutiina! Ngiyuka ti mukimukeba Yeesu wa Nazaleti, yowa wabe komena misumadi haulu ha musalaba; wazikuka! Ndadi haaŋa lungi, mulole bua dyabee mutundumika. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Haŋa, mwene muka saudile mitonge yaye na Petelo ti: wabatondokela ku Galilaya. Kokwa ni muka mumona bebya byeba saudileye.»<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Hakeaŋa baba baabakazi haba hezela haaza ya mufungu haba yena kabilo, bene muku sheeka na kuzeza na ndabee saudila mundu kumona bene na moyo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 16:8">Yeesu wakwimonesha kudi Madiya wa Magdala</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yoh 20.11-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24.13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Yeesu he fukukeye mukisi pee lufuku lwa yinga, we nyomokela bangu Malia wa Magdala. Yowa we shejya Yeesu mizuka musambo. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Yowa Malia bya yena kuka saudila baa mitonge ba Yeesu wowa musau, mukekya kindi benange mumadilo na mukudila. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Boobwa bwabutelegejya Madiya muusagula ti, Yeesu gudi muumi na ti, eyu Madiya gubumona, ndabutabu'a.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wayimonesha 'u mitakibwa yaayi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bym 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Biibi byooso ukila, Yeesu haya yimonesha na lweebu luungi udi mitakibwa yaayi yibidi, ebu ayinanga muzila, yiluyelela kwaabu. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Na baaba babuweena asawilanga bangi, na baaba babuwena asawilanga nababubatabu'a.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wa kwimonesha kudi mitonge baye kumi na yumo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Manyuma hashoo, Yeesu haya yimonesha u mitakibwa yaayi umi na yumu hanha hababwanangi muudya biyaazi. Haya batanyunwiina manee ga ulungila kwaabu ushu na matima gaabu goomini. Manee ndababutabu'a mahuya ga baaba babumumona hanha hebufuulu'a munda mwa bandu babu mota. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Ihani haya basawiila: «Mwenangi mu bwinaandu booso na mwenangi mwabasawiidi Mahuuya Gahyagahya u bwinandu booso boobwa Kabejya bwebubumba. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Yoowa wooso watabuanga Mahuuya Gahyagahya na umuyabi'a wa shoanga. Na yoowa wooso wakezemanga utabu'a, Kabejya wamutitiminyanga. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Kabejya wabagabilanga baaba batabuanga, boota bindu byoo hanunusha baandu: Ukidila zina dyaami, bajyanganga misimbusimbu munda mwa bandu. Na basagulanga busagudi buyabuya. <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Bawatanga nyo'a na mabo'o gaabu. Ishu boonya bindu byoobahega, bindu byoo bahega ndyabyoobata indu. Bahibianga mabo'o gaabu heegulu wa bandu badi lufu, na ebu bafuanga».<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeesu wabanda u lububi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24.50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bym 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Haŋa Vidi Yeesu hebuhwa ubasawiila bandu biibi, hayabaanda heegulu u lububi, na haya kaana mughela munumi wa ubo'o kwa Kabejya. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Ihani mitakibwa yaayi haya weena atanga mwandu u bandu booso wa Mahuuya Maleela mu bwinandu. Ngana gubuta bindu byabutu hamonga nabu, na haya bagabila butangala boota bindu byoo hanunusha bandu, koomonesha ti, mahuuya gabadi muta mwandu u bandu nga unindu.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>